tx-styling: Mejores prácticas ...","fr":"Guide de mise en place de tx-styling: Bonnes pratiques po...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für tx-styling: Best Practices für ...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do tx-styling para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка tx-styling для Разработчиков","ar":"إعداد أداة tx-styling للعاملين بالتطبيقات"},"description":{"en":"Discover how tx-styling simplifies Tailwind CSS management in React/Next.js apps - learn to integrate and debug with ease, start now!","zh":"了解 tx-styling 的 compile-time Tailwind 分组和 linting 功能，优化 React/Next.js 应用","ja":"tx-styling の compile-time Tailwind グループ化とlinting 機能を使用して React/Next.js アプリを最適化する","ko":"tx-styling의 compile-time Tailwind 그룹화 및 linting 기능을 사용하여 React/Next.js 애플리케이션을 최적화","es":"Aprende a utilizar tx-styling para mejorar la eficiencia de Tailwind en tus proyectos React y Next.js con esta guía detallada","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser tx-styling pour améliorer l''efficacité de Tailwind dans vos projets React et Next.js avec ce guide détaillé","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie tx-styling verwenden können, um die Effizienz von Tailwind in Ihren React- und Next.js-Projekten zu verbessern, mit diesem detaillierte...","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o tx-styling para melhorar a eficiência do seu código com Tailwind e React/Next.js","ru":"Настройте tx-styling для улучшения эффективности вашего кода с Tailwind и React/Next.js","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد أداة tx-styling لتحسين كفاءة кодك مع Tailwind و React/Next.js"},"definition":{"en":"tx-styling is a compile-time Tailwind grouping and linting tool, designed to streamline the use of Tailwind classes in component development.","zh":"tx-styling 是一种 compile-time Tailwind 分组和 linting 技术","ja":"tx-styling は compile-time Tailwind グループ化と linting 技術の一種です","ko":"tx-styling은 compile-time Tailwind 그룹화 및 linting 기술의 한 종류입니다","es":"tx-styling es una herramienta para la agrupación y el linting de Tailwind en tiempo de compilación","fr":"tx-styling est un outil pour le regroupement et le linting de Tailwind en temps de compilation","de":"tx-styling ist ein Tool für die Gruppierung und das Linting von Tailwind zur Compile-Zeit","pt":"O tx-styling é uma técnica de agrupamento de Tailwind em tempo de compilação com linting","ru":"tx-styling - это техника группировки Tailwind во время компиляции с linting","ar":"أداة tx-styling هي تقنية لترجمة وتجميع Tailwind في وقت الترجمة مع linting"},"features":{"en":["Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes","Use arrays for conditional styles, avoiding string concatenation","Utilize grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`","Forward only `className` props, not `tx` props","Optimize styleable components with specific linting rules"],"zh":["compile-time Tailwind 分组","linting 功能","支持 React/Next.js 应用","使用 tx 代替 className","使用数组进行条件样式","使用分组语法"],"ja":["compile-time Tailwind グループ化","linting 機能","React/Next.js アプリのサポート","tx を className に代入","配列を使用した条件スタイル","グループ化構文の使用"],"ko":["compile-time Tailwind 그룹화","linting 기능","React/Next.js 애플리케이션 지원","tx를 className으로 대체","배열을 사용한 조건부 스타일","그룹화 구문 사용"],"es":["Agrupación de Tailwind en tiempo de compilación","Linting para asegurar la calidad del código","Compatibilidad con React y Next.js","Uso de matrices para estilos condicionales","Sintaxis de agrupación como hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"fr":["Regroupement de Tailwind en temps de compilation","Linting pour assurer la qualité du code","Compatibilité avec React et Next.js","Utilisation de tableaux pour des styles conditionnels","Syntaxe de regroupement comme hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"de":["Gruppierung von Tailwind zur Compile-Zeit","Linting zur Sicherstellung der Code-Qualität","Kompatibilität mit React und Next.js","Verwendung von Arrays für bedingte Stile","Gruppierungssyntax wie hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"pt":["Agrupamento de Tailwind em tempo de compilação","Linting para melhorar a qualidade do código","Integração com React/Next.js","Uso de arrays para estilos condicionais","Sintaxe de agrupamento como hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"ru":["Группировка Tailwind во время компиляции","Linting для улучшения качества кода","Интеграция с React/Next.js","Использование массивов для условных стилей","Синтаксис группировки как hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"],"ar":["تجميع Tailwind في وقت الترجمة","linting لتحسين جودة الكود","التكامل مع React/Next.js","استخدام المصفوفات لاستYLES الشرطية","قواعد التجميع مثل hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tx-styling","tx-styling setup guide","Tailwind CSS optimization","tx-styling vs className","install tx-styling","debugging tx-styling in React","tx-styling for Next.js","what is tx-styling","tx-styling best practices"],"zh":["tx-styling","compile-time Tailwind","linting","React","Next.js","AIエージェント","前端开发","Web 开发","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["tx-styling","compile-time Tailwind","linting","React","Next.js","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発","Web 開発","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["tx-styling","compile-time Tailwind","linting","React","Next.js","AI 툴","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","linting","grupos de Tailwind","estilos condicionales","herramientas de desarrollo","mejores prácticas para Tailwind"],"fr":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","linting","groupes de Tailwind","styles conditionnels","outils de développement","bonnes pratiques pour Tailwind"],"de":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","Linting","Tailwind-Gruppen","bedingte Stile","Entwicklungstools","Best Practices für Tailwind"],"pt":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","compilação de tempo de execução","linting","agrupamento de Tailwind","estilos condicionais","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","компиляция времени выполнения","linting","группировка Tailwind","условные стили","веб-разработка"],"ar":["tx-styling","Tailwind","React","Next.js","ترجمة الوقت الفعلي","linting","تجميع Tailwind","استYLES الشرطية","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"landfolk","repo":"tx","repoPath":"landfolk/tx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tx-styling","description":"Guidance for using @landfolk/tx styling (tx prop, grouping syntax, Tailwind transformer, SWC + ESLint plugins) in React/Next.js.","bodyPreview":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, m","body":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, merge `className` into `tx`.\n\n## Tooling overview\n- SWC plugin rewrites `tx` to `className` at compile time.\n- Tailwind transformer expands grouped classes for JIT extraction.\n- ESLint rule sorts and validates classes.\n\n## Grouping syntax\nExample:\n\n```tsx\n<div tx=\"hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)\" />\n```\n\nCompiles to `className=\"hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\"`.\nGroups can be nested.\n\n## SWC transform\n- `tx=\"...\"` becomes `className=\"...\"`.\n- Arrays like `tx={[cond && tx`...`]}` become joined `className` arrays.\n- Tagged `tx` templates expand at compile time.\n- In dev, class strings can be wrapped with a conflict checker if registered.\n\nRegister the dev-only conflict checker once:\n\n```ts\nimport ''@landfolk/tx/checkConflicts''\n```\n\n## Tailwind transformer\nThe transformer scans `tx` attributes and template literals to expand grouped\nsyntax into full class lists so Tailwind JIT sees every class.\n\n## ESLint rule\n`@landfolk/tx/optimize-tailwind-classes`:\n- Expands grouped syntax and re-compacts in a stable order.\n- Sorts classes using Tailwind''s internal order.\n- Normalizes whitespace in arbitrary values.\n- Can validate class names when given a Tailwind config path.\n\n## Getting started\nSee `getting-started.md` for install, config, and Next.js compatibility.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:42.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js applications needing optimized Tailwind CSS styling and debugging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合专注于React和Next.js应用程序的前端代理，需要优化的Tailwind CSS样式和调试功能。","ja":"ReactおよびNext.jsアプリケーションに最適化されたTailwind CSSスタイリングとデバッグ機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 애플리케이션에 최적화된 Tailwind CSS 스타일링 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que se especializan en aplicaciones React y Next.js que necesitan estilos de Tailwind CSS optimizados y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend spécialisés dans les applications React et Next.js nécessitant un style Tailwind CSS optimisé et des capacités de débogage.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen spezialisieren, die optimierte Tailwind-CSS-Stile und Debugging-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em React e aplicações Next.js que necessitam de estilização Tailwind CSS otimizada e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на React и приложениях Next.js, требующих оптимизированного стиля Tailwind CSS и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يتخصصون في React وتطبيقات Next.js التي تحتاج إلى أسلوب Tailwind CSS محسّن وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage Tailwind classes using the `tx` prop, streamline conditional styles with arrays, and leverage grouping syntax for hover effects, all while ensuring seamless integration with `@landfolk/tx` and adherence to best practices for `tx` template literals and linting.","zh":"赋予代理高效地管理Tailwind类使用`tx`属性，使用数组简化条件样式，并利用分组语法进行悬停效果，同时确保与`@landfolk/tx`的无缝集成和遵循`tx`模板字面量和linting的最佳实践。","ja":"`tx`プロパティを使用してTailwindクラスを効率的に管理し、配列を使用して条件付きスタイルを簡素化し、グループ化構文を使用してホバーエフェクトを利用しながら、`@landfolk/tx`とのシームレスな統合と`tx`テンプレートリテラルおよびlintingのベストプラクティスへの従業を保証します。","ko":"`tx` 속성을 사용하여 Tailwind 클래스를 효율적으로 관리하고, 배열을 사용하여 조건부 스타일을 간소화하며, 그룹화 구문을 사용하여 호버 효과를 활용하는 동시에 `@landfolk/tx`와의無縫な統合 및 `tx` 템플릿 리터럴 및 린팅의 모범 사례를 따르는 것을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de manera eficiente las clases de Tailwind utilizando la propiedad `tx`, a optimizar los estilos condicionales con matrices y a aprovechar la sintaxis de agrupación para efectos de desplazamiento, todo ello garantizando una integración perfecta con `@landfolk/tx` y el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas para literales de plantilla `tx` y linting.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière efficace les classes Tailwind en utilisant la propriété `tx`, de rationaliser les styles conditionnels avec des tableaux et d''utiliser la syntaxe de regroupement pour les effets de survol, le tout en garantissant une intégration transparente avec `@landfolk/tx` et le respect des meilleures pratiques pour les littéraux de modèle `tx` et le linting.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Tailwind-Klassen effizient mit dem `tx`-Prop zu verwalten, bedingte Stile mit Arrays zu optimieren und die Gruppierungssyntax für Hover-Effekte zu nutzen, während sie gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Integration mit `@landfolk/tx` und die Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für `tx`-Template-Literale und Linting gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente as classes Tailwind usando a propriedade `tx`, simplificar estilos condicionais com matrizes e aproveitar a sintaxe de agrupamento para efeitos de hover, garantindo ao mesmo tempo uma integração sem problemas com `@landfolk/tx` e aderência às melhores práticas para literais de modelo `tx` e linting.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять классами Tailwind с помощью свойства `tx`, упрощать условные стили с помощью массивов и использовать синтаксис группировки для эффектов наведения, обеспечивая при этом бесшовную интеграцию с `@landfolk/tx` и соблюдение最佳 практик для литералов шаблона `tx` и линтинга.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الفئات Tailwind بفعالية باستخدام الخصية `tx`، وبسيطة الأشكال الشرطية باستخدام المصفوفات، وت tận dụng بناء الجملة المجموعة لأffects الحوفر، في الوقت نفسه الذي يضمن فيه التكامل السلس مع `@landfolk/tx` والامتثال لأفضل الممارسات للنماذج النصية `tx` وlinting."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing component styling with `tx` prop","Debugging Tailwind extraction and linting issues","Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into React/Next.js applications for enhanced styling"],"zh":["使用`tx`属性优化组件样式","调试Tailwind提取和linting问题","将`@landfolk/tx`集成到React/Next.js应用程序中以增强样式"],"ja":["`tx`プロパティを使用してコンポーネントスタイルを最適化する","Tailwind抽出とlintingの問題をデバッグする","`@landfolk/tx`をReact/Next.jsアプリケーションに統合してスタイルを強化する"],"ko":["`tx` 속성을 사용하여 컴포넌트 스타일을 최적화하는 것","Tailwind 추출 및 린팅 문제를 디버깅하는 것","`@landfolk/tx`를 React/Next.js 애플리케이션에 통합하여 스타일을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el estilo de componentes con la propiedad `tx`","Depurar problemas de extracción y linting de Tailwind","Integrar `@landfolk/tx` en aplicaciones React/Next.js para un estilo mejorado"],"fr":["Optimiser le style des composants avec la propriété `tx`","Déboguer les problèmes d''extraction et de linting de Tailwind","Intégrer `@landfolk/tx` dans des applications React/Next.js pour un style amélioré"],"de":["Optimieren des Komponenten-Stils mit dem `tx`-Prop","Debuggen von Tailwind-Extraktions- und Linting-Problemen","Integrieren von `@landfolk/tx` in React/Next.js-Anwendungen für ein verbessertes Styling"],"pt":["Otimizar estilização de componentes com propriedade `tx`","Depurar problemas de extração e linting do Tailwind","Integrar `@landfolk/tx` em aplicações React/Next.js para estilização aprimorada"],"ru":["Оптимизация стилизации компонентов с помощью свойства `tx`","Отладка проблем извлечения и линтинга Tailwind","Интеграция `@landfolk/tx` в приложения React/Next.js для улучшения стилизации"],"ar":["تحسين تنسيق المكونات باستخدام خاصية `tx`","فحص أخطاء استخراج وlinting Tailwind","دمج `@landfolk/tx` في تطبيقات React/Next.js لتحسين الأسلوب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js environment","Specific to Tailwind CSS and `@landfolk/tx` library"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js环境","特定于Tailwind CSS和`@landfolk/tx`库"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.js環境が必要","Tailwind CSSおよび`@landfolk/tx`ライブラリに特有"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 환경이 필요함","Tailwind CSS 및 `@landfolk/tx` 라이브러리에 특정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno React o Next.js","Específico para Tailwind CSS y la biblioteca `@landfolk/tx`"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React ou Next.js","Spécifique à Tailwind CSS et à la bibliothèque `@landfolk/tx`"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Tailwind CSS und die `@landfolk/tx`-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React ou Next.js","Específico para Tailwind CSS e biblioteca `@landfolk/tx`"],"ru":["Требуется среда React или Next.js","Специфичен для Tailwind CSS и библиотеки `@landfolk/tx`"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React أو Next.js","محدد لTailwind CSS ومكتبة `@landfolk/tx`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a70b545a68e73970643865122b4e2b17599fbcb309e0324edbdd9dca1a13e764","qualityScore":51}');
