ure de répertoires du graphique sous deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Établit les conventions du projet pour le graphique Helm","Permet le déploiement de SignalBeam Edge sur les appareils de bord","Utilise la syntaxe YAML pour définir les valeurs et les modèles du graphique","Inclut la création de fichiers tels que Chart.yaml, values.yaml et templates"],"de":["Erstellt die Verzeichnisstruktur des Diagramms unter deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Legt die ProjektKonventionen für das Helm-Diagramm fest","Ermöglicht die Bereitstellung von SignalBeam Edge auf Edge-Geräten","Verwendet die YAML-Syntax zur Definition der Werte und Vorlagen des Diagramms","Umfasst die Erstellung von Dateien wie Chart.yaml, values.yaml und templates"],"pt":["Criação de gráficos do Helm personalizados","Estrutura de diretórios personalizada","Arquivos Chart.yaml e values.yaml","Modelos de implantação e serviço","Suporte a configmap e ingress"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских графиков Helm","Пользовательская структура директорий","Файлы Chart.yaml и values.yaml","Шаблоны развертывания и сервиса","Поддержка configmap и ingress - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات Helm مخصصة","هيكل دليل مخصص","ملفات Chart.yaml و values.yaml","قوالب النشر والخدمة","دعم configmap و ingress - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use add-helm-chart","add-helm-chart setup guide","Helm chart creation","edge device management","add-helm-chart alternative","add-helm-chart vs Helm","automating deployments with add-helm-chart","add-helm-chart install","what is add-helm-chart"],"zh":["Helm图表","边缘设备管理","SignalBeam Edge","Helm包","边缘计算","容器化","Kubernetes","DevOps"],"ja":["Helmチャート","エッジデバイス管理","SignalBeam Edge","Helmパッケージ","エッジコンピューティング","コンテナ化","Kubernetes","DevOps","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Helm 차트","에지 디바이스 관리","SignalBeam Edge","Helm 패키지","에지 컴퓨팅","컨테이너화","Kubernetes","DevOps","AI 에이전트"],"es":["add-helm-chart","SignalBeam Edge","Helm","Kubernetes","dispositivos de borde","gráficos de Helm","YAML","desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["add-helm-chart","SignalBeam Edge","Helm","Kubernetes","appareils de bord","graphiques Helm","YAML","développement de logiciels","Outils de développement","Agents IA"],"de":["add-helm-chart","SignalBeam Edge","Helm","Kubernetes","Edge-Geräte","Helm-Diagramme","YAML","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","KI-Tools"],"pt":["add-helm-chart","gráficos do Helm","criação de gráficos","convenções do projeto","Helm","Kubernetes","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["add-helm-chart","графики Helm","создание графиков","конвенции проекта","Helm","Kubernetes","разработка программного обеспечения - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إضافة مخطط Helm","مخططات Helm","إنشاء مخططات","اتفاقيات المشروع","Helm","Kubernetes","تطوير البرمجيات - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"signalbeam-io","repo":"signalbeam-edge","repoPath":"signalbeam-io/signalbeam-edge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-helm-chart","description":"Scaffold a new Helm chart with standard templates and values. Use when deploying a new microservice or component to Kubernetes and it needs its own chart.","bodyPreview":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.clau","body":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.claude/rules/helm-charts.md` for project conventions.\n\n3. Generate files following these conventions:\n   - Namespace: `signalbeam`\n   - Standard Kubernetes labels: `app.kubernetes.io/name`, `app.kubernetes.io/instance`, `app.kubernetes.io/version`\n   - Health check paths: `/health/live` (liveness), `/health/ready` (readiness)\n   - Resource limits and requests with sensible defaults\n   - HPA with min 1, max 3 replicas\n\n4. **Chart.yaml** template:\n```yaml\napiVersion: v2\nname: {chart-name}\ndescription: {description}\ntype: application\nversion: 0.1.0\nappVersion: \"0.1.0\"\n```\n\n5. **values.yaml** — Include configurable values for:\n   - `image.repository`, `image.tag`, `image.pullPolicy`\n   - `replicaCount`\n   - `resources.requests` and `resources.limits`\n   - `service.type`, `service.port`\n   - `ingress.enabled`, `ingress.hosts`\n   - `env` (environment variables as key-value map)\n\n6. Validate the chart:\n```bash\nhelm lint deploy/charts/{chart-name}\nhelm template test deploy/charts/{chart-name} > /dev/null\n```\n\n## Output\n\nAfter scaffolding, report:\n```\n## Scaffolded: {chart-name} Helm chart\n\nFiles created:\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/Chart.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/values.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/_helpers.tpl`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/deployment.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/service.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/configmap.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/ingress.yaml`\n- `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/templates/hpa.yaml`\n\nValidation: helm lint {PASS/FAIL}\n\nNext: Customize `values.yaml` for the specific service, then run `/infra-lint helm`.\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- **Chart directory already exists:** Warn the user and ask whether to overwrite or extend the existing chart.\n- **Helm not installed:** Suggest installing with `brew install helm`.\n- **Lint fails after scaffolding:** Review template syntax — common issues are missing `{{- include }}` helpers or incorrect indentation.\n\n## After Scaffolding\n\nRemind to:\n- Customize `values.yaml` for the specific service\n- Add environment-specific value overrides if needed\n- Update any umbrella chart dependencies if applicable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:22.284Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing streamlined edge device management with Helm charts.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Helm charts简化边缘设备管理的DevOps Agents。","ja":"Helm chartsを使用してエッジデバイスの管理をストリームライン化する必要があるDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Helm charts를 사용하여 에지 디바이스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de dispositivos de borde simplificada con gráficos de Helm.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de périphériques de bord simplifiée avec des graphiques Helm.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Verwaltung von Edge-Geräten mit Helm-Chart benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gestão de dispositivos de borda simplificada com gráficos Helm.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется упрощенное управление устройствами края с помощью Helm-чартов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات DevOps التي تحتاج إلى إدارة جهاز حافة مبسطة مع رسوم Helm."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold new Helm charts following project conventions, utilizing Chart.yaml, values.yaml, and template files like deployment.yaml and service.yaml, to efficiently manage fleets of devices with Kubernetes.","zh":"赋予代理人创建新Helm charts的能力，遵循项目惯例，利用Chart.yaml、values.yaml和模板文件，如deployment.yaml和service.yaml，高效地管理设备群集以Kubernetes。","ja":"エージェントに新しいHelm chartsを作成する能力を与え、プロジェクトの規約に従って、Chart.yaml、values.yaml、テンプレートファイル（例：deployment.yaml、service.yaml）を利用して、Kubernetesでデバイスのフリートを効率的に管理します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 규칙에 따라 새로운 Helm charts를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Chart.yaml, values.yaml 및 템플릿 파일(예: deployment.yaml, service.yaml)을 사용하여 Kubernetes로 디바이스 그룹을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos gráficos de Helm siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto, utilizando Chart.yaml, values.yaml y archivos de plantilla como deployment.yaml y service.yaml, para gestionar de manera eficiente flotas de dispositivos con Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux graphiques Helm en suivant les conventions de projet, en utilisant Chart.yaml, values.yaml et des fichiers de modèle comme deployment.yaml et service.yaml, pour gérer efficacement des flottes de périphériques avec Kubernetes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Helm-Chart nach Projektübereinkünften zu erstellen, indem Chart.yaml, values.yaml und Vorlagendateien wie deployment.yaml und service.yaml verwendet werden, um Flotten von Geräten mit Kubernetes effizient zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos gráficos Helm seguindo as convenções do projeto, utilizando Chart.yaml, values.yaml e arquivos de modelo como deployment.yaml e service.yaml, para gerenciar de forma eficiente frotas de dispositivos com Kubernetes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать новые Helm-чарты в соответствии с конвенциями проекта, используя Chart.yaml, values.yaml и файлы шаблонов, такие как deployment.yaml и service.yaml, для эффективного управления флотами устройств с помощью Kubernetes.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء مخططات Helm الجديدة اتباعًا لتقاليد المشروع، باستخدام Chart.yaml و values.yaml وملفات النموذج مثل deployment.yaml و service.yaml، من أجل إدارة السفن من الأجهزة بفعالية مع Kubernetes."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Helm charts for edge devices","Streamlining fleet management with standardized chart structures","Automating template generation for Kubernetes deployments"],"zh":["为边缘设备创建新的Helm charts","使用标准化的图表结构简化集群管理","自动为Kubernetes部署生成模板"],"ja":["エッジデバイス用の新しいHelm chartsの作成","標準化されたチャート構造を使用したフリート管理のストリームライン化","Kubernetesデプロイメントのテンプレート自動生成"],"ko":["에지 디바이스를 위한 새로운 Helm charts 생성","표준화된 차트 구조를 사용한 디바이스 그룹 관리 간소화","Kubernetes 배포를 위한 템플릿 자동 생성"],"es":["Creación de nuevos gráficos de Helm para dispositivos de borde","Simplificación de la gestión de flotas con estructuras de gráficos estandarizados","Automatización de la generación de plantillas para implementaciones de Kubernetes"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux graphiques Helm pour les périphériques de bord","Simplification de la gestion de flottes avec des structures de graphiques standardisées","Automatisation de la génération de modèles pour les déploiements Kubernetes"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Helm-Chart für Edge-Geräte","Vereinfachung der Flottenverwaltung mit standardisierten Chart-Strukturen","Automatisierung der Vorlagengenerierung für Kubernetes-Deployments"],"pt":["Criação de novos gráficos Helm para dispositivos de borda","Simplificação da gestão de frotas com estruturas de gráficos padronizadas","Geração automática de modelos para implantações Kubernetes"],"ru":["Создание новых Helm-чартов для устройств края","Упрощение управления флотами с помощью стандартизированных структур чартов","Автоматическая генерация шаблонов для развертывания Kubernetes"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات Helm الجديدة للأجهزة الحافة","تبسيط إدارة الأساطيل مع هياكل مخططات معيارية","توليد автомاتي للنماذج لتنصيب Kubernetes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project conventions for chart structure","Limited to Helm chart creation, not management or deployment"],"zh":["需要项目惯例来定义图表结构","仅限于Helm图表的创建，不包括管理或部署"],"ja":["チャート構造を定義するためのプロジェクト規約が必要","Helmチャートの作成のみに限定され、管理またはデプロイは含まれません"],"ko":["차트 구조를 정의하기 위한 프로젝트 규칙이 필요","Helm 차트 생성만으로 제한되며, 관리 또는 배포는 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere convenciones de proyecto para la estructura del gráfico","Limitado a la creación de gráficos de Helm, no a la gestión o implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite des conventions de projet pour la structure du graphique","Limité à la création de graphiques Helm, et non à la gestion ou au déploiement"],"de":["Benötigt Projektübereinkünfte für die Chart-Struktur","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Helm-Chart, nicht auf Verwaltung oder Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Exige convenções de projeto para estrutura de gráfico","Limitado à criação de gráficos Helm, não à gestão ou implantação"],"ru":["Требует конвенций проекта для структуры чарта","Ограничен созданием Helm-чартов, но не их управлением или развертыванием"],"ar":["يتطلب تقاليد مشروع لSTRUCTURE المخطط","محدود بإنشاء مخططات Helm، وليس إدارتها أو نشرها"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b473e4218a709c1343add5ecb72bc36e7c573ed67cbb83ee4893a3264ca7a63e","qualityScore":51}');
