 async/await"],"de":["Definition von Endpunktkonstanten in app/webapp.py","Erstellung von asynchronen Handler-Funktionen mit Decoratoren","Unterstützung für aioswitcher-API-Methoden","Erstellung neuer Abfrage-Endpunkte","Steuerung von Switcher-Smart-Geräten in kontainerisierter Form","Integration mit Python und async/await"],"pt":["Acesso containerizado a dispositivos Switcher locais","Adição de novas funcionalidades de controle de dispositivos","Criação de novos pontos de extremidade para consulta","Uso de Python para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Integração com a API aioswitcher","Suporte a métodos HTTP como GET, POST, PATCH e DELETE"],"ru":["Контейнеризированный доступ к локальным устройствам Switcher","Добавление новых функций управления устройствами","Создание новых точек окончания для запросов","Использование Python для разработки приложений","Интеграция с API aioswitcher","Поддержка методов HTTP как GET, POST, PATCH и DELETE"],"ar":["الوصول إلى الأجهزة المحلية Switcher المحتوى","إضافة وظائف تحكم جديدة","إنشاء نقاط نهاية جديدة للاستفسار","استخدام بايثون لتطوير التطبيقات","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات aioswitcher","دعم أساليب HTTP مثل GET و POST و PATCH و DELETE"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use add-endpoint","add-endpoint setup guide","containerized access to Switcher devices","aioswitcher API methods","add-endpoint vs other smart device skills","add-endpoint install for developers","what is add-endpoint","add-endpoint alternative for device control","add-endpoint tutorial for AI agents"],"zh":["add-endpoint","AI智能工具","Switcher智能设备","Python","异步处理","HTTP方法","aioswitcher API"],"ja":["add-endpoint","AIエージェント","Switcherスマートデバイス","Python","非同期ハンドラー","HTTPメソッド","aioswitcher API"],"ko":["add-endpoint","AI 도구","Switcher 스마트 디바이스","Python","비동기 핸들러","HTTP 메소드","aioswitcher API"],"es":["add-endpoint","AI Agent","dispositivos Switcher","control de dispositivos","Python","async/await","aioswitcher","API de aioswitcher","puntos finales de consulta","contenerización"],"fr":["add-endpoint","outils IA","appareils Switcher","contrôle d''appareils","Python","async/await","aioswitcher","API de aioswitcher","points de terminaison de requête","conteneurisation"],"de":["add-endpoint","AI-Tools","Switcher-Geräte","Gerätesteuerung","Python","async/await","aioswitcher","aioswitcher-API","Abfrage-Endpunkte","Kontainerisierung"],"pt":["add-endpoint","controle de dispositivos Switcher","acesso containerizado","Python","API aioswitcher","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","pontos de extremidade","métodos HTTP","ferramentas de AI"],"ru":["add-endpoint","управление устройствами Switcher","контейнеризированный доступ","Python","API aioswitcher","разработка приложений","точки окончания","методы HTTP","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["وظيفة الإضافة","تحكم الأجهزة الذكية Switcher","الوصول إلى الأجهزة المحلية","بايثون","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات aioswitcher","تطوير التطبيقات","نقاط النهاية","أساليب HTTP","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"TomerFi","repo":"switcher_webapi","repoPath":"TomerFi/switcher_webapi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.443Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-endpoint","description":"Step-by-step guide for adding a new API endpoint to switcher_webapi. Use when adding new device functionality or API routes.","bodyPreview":"# Adding a New Endpoint\n\n## When to Use\n- Adding new device control functionality\n- Exposing new aioswitcher API methods\n- Creating new query endpoints\n\n## Step 1: Define Endpoint Constant\n\nIn `app/webapp.py`, add the endpoint path constant (around line 54-71):\n\n```python\nENDPOINT_YOUR_ENDPOINT = \"/switcher/your_endpoint\"\n```\n\n## Step 2: Create Handler Function\n\nAdd the async handler with the appropriate decorator:\n\n```python\n@routes.get(ENDPOINT_YOUR_ENDPOINT)  # or .post, .patch, .delete\nasync","body":"# Adding a New Endpoint\n\n## When to Use\n- Adding new device control functionality\n- Exposing new aioswitcher API methods\n- Creating new query endpoints\n\n## Step 1: Define Endpoint Constant\n\nIn `app/webapp.py`, add the endpoint path constant (around line 54-71):\n\n```python\nENDPOINT_YOUR_ENDPOINT = \"/switcher/your_endpoint\"\n```\n\n## Step 2: Create Handler Function\n\nAdd the async handler with the appropriate decorator:\n\n```python\n@routes.get(ENDPOINT_YOUR_ENDPOINT)  # or .post, .patch, .delete\nasync def your_endpoint(request: web.Request) -> web.Response:\n    \"\"\"Describe what this endpoint does.\"\"\"\n    device_type = DEVICES[request.query[KEY_TYPE]]\n    if KEY_LOGIN_KEY in request.query:\n        login_key = request.query[KEY_LOGIN_KEY]\n    else:\n        login_key = \"00\"\n    async with SwitcherApi(\n        device_type, request.query[KEY_IP], request.query[KEY_ID], login_key\n    ) as swapi:\n        result = await swapi.your_method()\n        return web.json_response(_serialize_object(result))\n```\n\n## Step 3: Add Tests\n\nIn `app/tests/test_web_app.py`, add test cases:\n\n```python\n@mark.parametrize(\"url\", [\n    \"/switcher/your_endpoint?type=plug&id=ab1c2d&ip=1.2.3.4\",\n    \"/switcher/your_endpoint?type=plug&id=ab1c2d&ip=1.2.3.4&key=18\",\n])\nasync def test_successful_your_endpoint_get_request(api_client, url):\n    with patch(\"app.webapp.SwitcherApi\") as mock_api:\n        mock_api.return_value.__aenter__.return_value.your_method = AsyncMock(\n            return_value=expected_response\n        )\n        resp = await api_client.get(url)\n        assert resp.status == 200\n```\n\n## Step 4: Update Documentation\n\nCreate or update the relevant docs file in `docs/`:\n- Add endpoint to the appropriate `endpoints_*.md` file\n- Include method, path, description, and query parameters\n\n## Step 5: Run Tests\n\nUse the `/test` command to run tests with coverage.\n\n## Reference\n\nLook at existing endpoints for patterns:\n- `get_state` - Simple GET returning device state\n- `turn_on` - POST with optional body parameters\n- `control_breeze_device` - PATCH with complex body handling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:08:42.316Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-based AI Agents needing to control and query local Switcher smart devices through containerized access","zh":"非常适合需要通过容器化访问控制和查询本地 Switcher 智能设备的 Python 基础 AI 代理","ja":"PythonベースのAIエージェントがローカルのSwitcherスマートデバイスをコンテナ化されたアクセスで制御および照会する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"컨테이너화된 액세스를 통해 로컬 Switcher 스마트 장치를 제어하고 쿼리해야 하는 Python 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Python que necesitan controlar y consultar dispositivos inteligentes Switcher locales a través del acceso contenedorizado","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Python qui ont besoin de contrôler et d''interroger les appareils intelligents Switcher locaux via un accès conteneurisé","de":"Perfekt für Python-basierte KI-Agents, die Switcher-Smart-Geräte lokal über kontainerisierten Zugriff steuern und abfragen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Python que precisam controlar e consultar dispositivos inteligentes Switcher locais por meio de acesso containerizado","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Python, которым необходимо контролировать и запрашивать локальные умные устройства Switcher через контейнеризированный доступ","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى Python التي تحتاج إلى التحكم في استفسار الأجهزة الذكية المحلية Switcher من خلال الوصول المُحَوّص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to add new device control functionality and expose aioswitcher API methods, leveraging Python''s async capabilities and RESTful API endpoints like GET, POST, PATCH, and DELETE","zh":"赋予代理添加新的设备控制功能并暴露 aioswitcher API 方法的能力，利用 Python 的异步能力和 RESTful API 端点，如 GET、POST、PATCH 和 DELETE","ja":"エージェントに新しいデバイス制御機能を追加し、aioswitcher API メソッドを公開する機能を与え、Python の非同期機能と RESTful API エンドポイント (GET、POST、PATCH、DELETE など) を利用","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 장치 제어 기능을 추가하고 aioswitcher API 메서드를 노출할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 Python의 비동기 기능과 RESTful API 엔드포인트(예: GET, POST, PATCH, DELETE)를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a agregar nueva funcionalidad de control de dispositivos y exponer métodos de la API aioswitcher, aprovechando las capacidades asíncronas de Python y los puntos de conexión de la API RESTful como GET, POST, PATCH y DELETE","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ajouter de nouvelles fonctionnalités de contrôle d''appareils et d''exposer des méthodes d''API aioswitcher, en exploitant les capacités asynchrones de Python et les points de terminaison d''API RESTful tels que GET, POST, PATCH et DELETE","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, neue Gerätesteuerungsfunktionen hinzuzufügen und aioswitcher API-Methoden zu exponieren, indem sie die asynchronen Fähigkeiten von Python und RESTful API-Endpunkte wie GET, POST, PATCH und DELETE nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a adicionar nova funcionalidade de controle de dispositivos e expor métodos da API aioswitcher, aproveitando as capacidades assíncronas do Python e os pontos de extremidade da API RESTful como GET, POST, PATCH e DELETE","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью добавлять новую функциональность управления устройствами и экспонировать методы API aioswitcher, используя асинхронные возможности Python и точки RESTful API, такие как GET, POST, PATCH и DELETE","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إضافة وظيفية新的 للتحكم في الأجهزة و كشف أساليب API aioswitcher، واستغلال القدرات غير المتزامنة ل Python و نهاية RESTful API مثل GET و POST و PATCH و DELETE"},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new device control functionality","Exposing new aioswitcher API methods","Creating new query endpoints"],"zh":["添加新的设备控制功能","暴露新的 aioswitcher API 方法","创建新的查询端点"],"ja":["新しいデバイス制御機能を追加する","新しい aioswitcher API メソッドを公開する","新しいクエリエンドポイントを作成する"],"ko":["新的 장치 제어 기능을 추가","新的 aioswitcher API 메서드를 노출","新的 쿼리 엔드포인트를 생성"],"es":["Agregar nueva funcionalidad de control de dispositivos","Exponer nuevos métodos de la API aioswitcher","Crear nuevos puntos de consulta"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouvelles fonctionnalités de contrôle d''appareils","Exposer de nouvelles méthodes d''API aioswitcher","Créer de nouveaux points de terminaison de requête"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Gerätesteuerungsfunktionen","Exponieren neuer aioswitcher API-Methoden","Erstellen neuer Abfrageendpunkte"],"pt":["Adicionar nova funcionalidade de controle de dispositivos","Expor novos métodos da API aioswitcher","Criar novos pontos de extremidade de consulta"],"ru":["Добавление новой функциональности управления устройствами","Экспонирование новых методов API aioswitcher","Создание новых точек запроса"],"ar":["إضافة وظيفية جديدة للتحكم في الأجهزة","إظهار أساليب جديدة ل API aioswitcher","إنشاء نقاط نهاية استفسار جديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires modification of app/webapp.py","Limited to Switcher smart devices","Python 3.x compatibility required"],"zh":["需要修改 app/webapp.py","仅限 Switcher 智能设备","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性"],"ja":["app/webapp.py の変更が必要","Switcher スマートデバイスに限定","Python 3.x との互換性が必要"],"ko":["app/webapp.py 수정 필요","Switcher 스마트 장치에 한정","Python 3.x 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la modificación de app/webapp.py","Limitado a dispositivos inteligentes Switcher","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x"],"fr":["Nécessite la modification de app/webapp.py","Limité aux appareils intelligents Switcher","La compatibilité Python 3.x est requise"],"de":["Erfordert die Modifizierung von app/webapp.py","Begrenzt auf Switcher-Smart-Geräte","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer modificação do app/webapp.py","Limitado a dispositivos inteligentes Switcher","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária"],"ru":["Требуется изменение app/webapp.py","Ограничен умными устройствами Switcher","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x"],"ar":["يتطلب تعديل app/webapp.py","محدود بأجهزة Switcher الذكية","متطلبات التوافق مع Python 3.x"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"25c9c132985d10ada08c672a6df19a7ae87d0572762ae18d9d3ec29cbfe3b6a1","qualityScore":51}');
