function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application.","zh":"自定义全局事件是一种跨组件通信机制，允许在不依赖 React Context 的情况下触发事件","ja":"カスタムグローバルイベントは、React Context 依存関係なしでイベントをトリガーするクロスコンポーネント通信メカニズム","ko":"커스텀 글로벌 이벤트는 React Context 의존성 없이 이벤트를 트리거하는 跨组件通信 메커니즘","es":"Custom-global-events es un sistema de eventos globales para la comunicación entre componentes","fr":"Custom-global-events est un système d''événements globaux pour la communication inter-composants","de":"Custom-global-events ist ein System von globalen Ereignissen für die Komponentenkommunikation","pt":"Os eventos globais personalizados são um sistema de comunicação entre componentes que não depende do contexto React.","ru":"Пользовательские глобальные события - это система跨компонентной коммуникации, не зависящая от контекста React.","ar":"الأحداث العالمية المخصصة هي نظام اتصال بين المكونات لا يعتمد على سياق React."},"features":{"en":["Enables cross-component communication without React context dependencies","Allows for simple function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application","Utilizes a global events system defined in global-event.tsx","Supports communication between different parts of the application","Provides a simple alternative to React context for event triggering"],"zh":["跨组件通信","无 React Context 依赖","简单函数调用触发事件","global-event.tsx 文件支持"],"ja":["クロスコンポーネント通信","React Context 依存関係なし","シンプルな関数呼び出しでイベントをトリガー","global-event.tsx ファイルサポート"],"ko":["跨组件通信","React Context 의존성 없음","간단한 함수 호출로 이벤트 트리거","global-event.tsx 파일 지원"],"es":["Comunicación entre componentes sin React context","Llamadas de funciones simples para disparar eventos","Utiliza el archivo global-event.tsx","Permite la comunicación entre diferentes partes de la aplicación","No requiere dependencias de React context"],"fr":["Communication inter-composants sans React context","Appels de fonctions simples pour déclencher des événements","Utilise le fichier global-event.tsx","Permet la communication entre différentes parties de l''application","Nécessite pas de dépendances de React context"],"de":["Komponentenkommunikation ohne React-Context","Einfache Funktionsaufrufe zum Auslösen von Ereignissen","Verwendet die Datei global-event.tsx","Ermöglicht die Kommunikation zwischen verschiedenen Teilen der Anwendung","Benötigt keine Abhängigkeiten von React-Context"],"pt":["Comunicação entre componentes sem dependências de contexto React","Chamadas de funções simples para disparar eventos","Utilização de eventos globais para comunicação em diferentes partes da aplicação","Integração com React para desenvolvimento de aplicações","Sistema de eventos globais personalizados para cross-component communication"],"ru":["Кросскомпонентная коммуникация без зависимостей от контекста React","Простые вызовы функций для запуска событий","Использование глобальных событий для коммуникации в разных частях приложения","Интеграция с React для разработки приложений","Система пользовательских глобальных событий для跨компонентной коммуникации"],"ar":["اتصال بين المكونات بدون зависимости على سياق React","إجراء مكالمات دالة بسيطة لتنفيذ الأحداث","استخدام الأحداث العالمية للاتصال في أجزاء مختلفة من التطبيق","التكامل مع React لتنمية التطبيقات","نظام الأحداث العالمية المخصصة للاتصال بين المكونات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use custom-global-events","what is custom-global-events","custom-global-events alternative","custom-global-events vs React context","custom-global-events install","custom-global-events setup guide","cross-component communication","React application development","global events system"],"zh":["自定义全局事件","AIエージェント","React Context","跨组件通信","global-event.tsx","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"ja":["カスタムグローバルイベント","AIエージェント","React Context","クロスコンポーネント通信","global-event.tsx","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"ko":["커스텀 글로벌 이벤트","AI 에이전트","React Context","跨组件通信","global-event.tsx","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"es":["custom-global-events","comunicación entre componentes","React context","eventos globales","llamadas de funciones simples","global-event.tsx","Herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","Agentes de IA para programación"],"fr":["custom-global-events","communication inter-composants","React context","événements globaux","appels de fonctions simples","global-event.tsx","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Agents d''IA pour la programmation"],"de":["custom-global-events","Komponentenkommunikation","React-Context","globale Ereignisse","einfache Funktionsaufrufe","global-event.tsx","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agenten für die Programmierung"],"pt":["eventos globais personalizados","comunicação entre componentes","React","contexto React","desenvolvimento de aplicações","sistema de eventos globais","cross-component communication"],"ru":["пользовательские глобальные события","кросскомпонентная коммуникация","React","контекст React","разработка приложений","система глобальных событий","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["الأحداث العالمية المخصصة","اتصال بين المكونات","React","سياق React","تنمية التطبيقات","نظام الأحداث العالمية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"raythurnvoid","repo":"experiment--t3-chat","repoPath":"raythurnvoid/experiment--t3-chat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.495Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"custom-global-events","description":"Guidelines for creating/using the app’s typed global events system.","bodyPreview":"# Overview\n\nGlobal events are used for cross-component communication without React context dependencies, allowing for simple function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application.\n\n# Global Events Guidelines\n\nGlobal events are used for cross-component communication without React context dependencies, allowing for simple function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application.\n\n# Overview\n\nThe global events system lives at [global-event.tsx](../../../packag","body":"# Overview\n\nGlobal events are used for cross-component communication without React context dependencies, allowing for simple function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application.\n\n# Global Events Guidelines\n\nGlobal events are used for cross-component communication without React context dependencies, allowing for simple function calls to trigger events across different parts of the application.\n\n# Overview\n\nThe global events system lives at [global-event.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/lib/global-event.tsx) and is built on a typed `Event` subclass (`XCustomEvent`).\n\nIt exposes:\n\n- `global_event_Event`: the canonical type map of event keys → `detail` payload types\n- `global_event_dispatch(event, payload)`: dispatch a typed event (works outside React)\n- `global_event_listen(event, handler, options?)`: listen with typed handler (works outside React)\n- `useGlobalEvent(event, handler)`: React hook for subscriptions with stale-closure protection\n\n# Event key naming\n\nEvent keys are string literals using the pattern:\n\n(`module::event_name`), for example `ai_chat::open_canvas`.\n\n# How to add or modify an event\n\nWhen the user requests a new global event, you must:\n\n# Update the event map\n\nAdd the new event key to the `global_event_Event` map in [global-event.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/lib/global-event.tsx).\n\nExample:\n\n```ts\nexport class global_event_Event extends XCustomEvent<{\n\t\"ai_chat::open_canvas\": {\n\t\tpageId: app_convex_Id<\"pages\">;\n\t\tmode: \"diff\" | \"editor\";\n\t\tmodifiedContent?: string;\n\t\tthreadId: string;\n\t};\n\t\"ai_chat::open_canvas_by_path\": {\n\t\tpath: string;\n\t};\n\t\"docs::focus_path\": {\n\t\tpath: string;\n\t};\n}> {}\n```\n\n# Keep all event keys centralized\n\nAll supported global event keys must be declared in that `global_event_Event` type map. Do not introduce ad-hoc stringly-typed events elsewhere.\n\n# Use the exported helpers\n\nPrefer `global_event_dispatch` / `global_event_listen` / `useGlobalEvent` rather than calling `window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(...))` directly.\n\n# Usage patterns\n\n## React components\n\nUse `useGlobalEvent(eventName, handler)` to subscribe. The handler receives a typed event object, and the payload is on `event.detail`.\n\nExample (from [canvas.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/components/canvas/canvas.tsx)):\n\n```ts\nuseGlobalEvent(\"ai_chat::open_canvas\", (e) => {\n\tconst payload = e.detail;\n\t// payload.pageId, payload.mode, payload.modifiedContent, payload.threadId\n});\n```\n\n## Non-React code (or manual lifecycle control)\n\nUse `global_event_listen` directly when you need to wire AbortController, or you are outside React.\n\n```ts\nconst controller = new AbortController();\n\nconst cleanup = global_event_listen(\n\t\"ai_chat::open_canvas_by_path\",\n\t(e) => {\n\t\tconsole.info(\"path:\", e.detail.path);\n\t},\n\t{ signal: controller.signal },\n);\n\n// later:\ncontroller.abort();\ncleanup();\n```\n\n## Dispatching\n\nUse `global_event_dispatch(eventName, payload)` from anywhere client-side.\n\nExample (from [app-ai-chat.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/components/app-ai-chat.tsx)):\n\n```ts\nglobal_event_dispatch(\"ai_chat::open_canvas_by_path\", { path: args.path });\n```\n\n# Handler typing and payload access\n\nHandlers receive the typed event object, not the payload directly:\n\n```ts\nuseGlobalEvent(\"ai_chat::open_canvas\", (e) => {\n\tconst payload = e.detail;\n});\n```\n\n# Files and references\n\n- Core implementation: [global-event.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/lib/global-event.tsx)\n- Typed event base: `XCustomEvent` in [utils.ts](../../../packages/app/src/lib/utils.ts)\n- Hook helper: `useLiveRef` in [utils-hooks.ts](../../../packages/app/src/hooks/utils-hooks.ts)\n- Example consumers: [app-ai-chat.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/components/app-ai-chat.tsx), [canvas.tsx](../../../packages/app/src/components/canvas/canvas.tsx)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:11.509Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents working with complex React applications needing simplified cross-component communication","zh":"非常适合与复杂React应用程序合作的前端代理，需要简化的跨组件通信","ja":"複雑なReactアプリケーションで作業するフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、クロスコンポーネント通信を簡素化する必要があります","ko":"복잡한 React 애플리케이션에서 일하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 간소화된 크로스 컴포넌트 통신이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que trabajan con aplicaciones React complejas que necesitan una comunicación entre componentes simplificada","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui travaillent avec des applications React complexes nécessitant une communication entre composants simplifiée","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die mit komplexen React-Anwendungen arbeiten, die eine vereinfachte Kommunikation zwischen Komponenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que trabalham com aplicações React complexas que precisam de comunicação entre componentes simplificada","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, работающих с сложными приложениями React, которым требуется упрощенная связь между компонентами","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يعملون مع تطبيقات React المعقدة التي تحتاج إلى تواصل بين المكونات مبسط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger events across different parts of the application using simple function calls, without relying on React context dependencies, and utilizing global events systems like the one defined in global-event.tsx","zh":"赋予代理在不同应用程序部分触发事件的能力，使用简单的函数调用，而不依赖于React上下文依赖，并利用诸如global-event.tsx中定义的全局事件系统","ja":"エージェントがReactコンテキスト依存関係に依存せずに、異なるアプリケーション部分でイベントをトリガーする機能を提供し、単純な関数呼び出しを使用し、global-event.tsxで定義されているようなグローバルイベントシステムを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 React 컨텍스트 종속성을 의존하지 않고, 다른 애플리케이션 부분에서 이벤트를 트리거하는 기능을 제공하며, 간단한 함수 호출을 사용하고, global-event.tsx에서 정의한 것과 같은 전역 이벤트 시스템을 활용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desencadenar eventos en diferentes partes de la aplicación utilizando llamadas a funciones simples, sin depender de las dependencias del contexto de React, y utilizando sistemas de eventos globales como el definido en global-event.tsx","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des événements dans différentes parties de l''application en utilisant des appels de fonction simples, sans dépendre des dépendances de contexte de React, et en utilisant des systèmes d''événements globaux comme celui défini dans global-event.tsx","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Ereignisse in verschiedenen Teilen der Anwendung auszulösen, indem sie einfache Funktionsaufrufe verwenden, ohne auf React-Kontext-Abhängigkeiten angewiesen zu sein und globale Ereignissysteme wie das in global-event.tsx definierte verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a disparar eventos em diferentes partes do aplicativo usando chamadas de função simples, sem depender das dependências de contexto do React e utilizando sistemas de eventos globais como o definido em global-event.tsx","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать события в различных частях приложения, используя простые вызовы функций, не полагаясь на зависимости контекста React и используя глобальные системы событий, такие как определенные в global-event.tsx","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل الأحداث عبر أجزاء مختلفة من التطبيق باستخدام呼呼 دالات بسيطة، دون الاعتماد على الإعتمادات السياقية ل React وتستخدم أنظمة الأحداث العالمية مثل تلك المحددة في global-event.tsx"},"useCases":{"en":["Triggering global events for cross-component communication","Simplifying React application development by avoiding context dependencies","Enabling seamless interaction between disparate application components"],"zh":["触发全局事件用于跨组件通信","通过避免上下文依赖来简化React应用程序开发","使不同应用程序组件之间的交互无缝"],"ja":["クロスコンポーネント通信のためのグローバルイベントのトリガー","コンテキスト依存関係を避けることでReactアプリケーションの開発を簡素化する","異なるアプリケーションコンポーネント間のシームレスな相互作用を可能にする"],"ko":["크로스 컴포넌트 통신을 위한 전역 이벤트 트리거","컨텍스트 종속성을 피함으로써 React 애플리케이션 개발을 단순화하는 것","다른 애플리케이션 컴포넌트 간의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 함"],"es":["Desencadenar eventos globales para la comunicación entre componentes","Simplificar el desarrollo de aplicaciones React evitando las dependencias de contexto","Habilitar la interacción sin problemas entre componentes de aplicaciones dispares"],"fr":["Déclencher des événements globaux pour la communication entre composants","Simplifier le développement d''applications React en évitant les dépendances de contexte","Permettre l''interaction sans heurts entre les composants d''applications disparates"],"de":["Auslösen globaler Ereignisse für die Kommunikation zwischen Komponenten","Vereinfachen der Entwicklung von React-Anwendungen, indem die Kontext-Abhängigkeiten vermieden werden","Ermöglichen der reibungslosen Interaktion zwischen den Komponenten verschiedener Anwendungen"],"pt":["Disparar eventos globais para comunicação entre componentes","Simplificar o desenvolvimento de aplicações React evitando dependências de contexto","Habilitar interação sem problemas entre componentes de aplicativos diferentes"],"ru":["Запуск глобальных событий для связи между компонентами","Упрощение разработки приложений React, избегая зависимостей контекста","Обеспечение беспроблемного взаимодействия между различными компонентами приложений"],"ar":["تشغيل الأحداث العالمية للاتصال بين المكونات","تبسيط تطوير تطبيقات React عن طريق تجنب الإعتماديات السياقية","تمكين التفاعل السلس بين مكونات تطبيقات مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React application environment","Limited to cross-component communication within the same application"],"zh":["需要React应用程序环境","仅限于同一应用程序内的跨组件通信"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーション環境が必要","同一アプリケーション内でのみクロスコンポーネント通信に限定される"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션 환경이 필요","同じ 애플리케이션 내에서만 크로스 컴포넌트 통신이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de aplicación React","Limitado a la comunicación entre componentes dentro de la misma aplicación"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''application React","Limité à la communication entre composants au sein de la même application"],"de":["Benötigt eine React-Anwendungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die Kommunikation zwischen Komponenten innerhalb der gleichen Anwendung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de aplicativo React","Limitado à comunicação entre componentes dentro do mesmo aplicativo"],"ru":["Требует среды приложения React","Ограничен связью между компонентами внутри одного и того же приложения"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطبيق React","محدود بالاتصال بين المكونات داخل نفس التطبيق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6105e1ccbcf965488032cfc07df80c76ae480aba25674a4ef20454ecdf4cbb7f","qualityScore":51}');
