 и ограничением скорости","Доступ к базам данных и кэширование","Аутентификация и авторизация","Обработка ошибок и логов"],"ar":["هياكل RESTful ل APIs","أمان مع headers و rate limiting","وصول إلى قواعد البيانات و caching","تحقق الهوية و تفويض","معالجة الأخطاء و سجلات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use backend-patterns","backend-patterns for Node.js","RESTful API design tutorial","backend-patterns vs Express","backend-patterns setup guide","scalable server-side logic"],"zh":["Node.js后端模式","RESTful结构","API设计","后端模式设计","Node.js服务器安全性","后端模式实现"],"ja":["Node.jsバックエンドパターン","RESTful構造","API設計","バックエンドパターンデザイン","Node.jsサーバーセキュリティ","バックエンドパターン実装"],"ko":["Node.js 백엔드 패턴","RESTful 구조","API 설계","백엔드 패턴 설계","Node.js 서버 보안성","백엔드 패턴 구현"],"es":["patrones de desarrollo backend","diseño de API","seguridad de servidores","Node.js","Express","RESTful","autenticación","autorización","bases de datos","trabajos en segundo plano"],"fr":["modèles de développement backend","conception d''API","sécurité des serveurs","Node.js","Express","RESTful","authentification","autorisation","bases de données","tâches en arrière-plan"],"de":["Backend-Entwicklungs-Muster","API-Design","Sicherheit von Servern","Node.js","Express","RESTful","Authentifizierung","Autorisierung","Datenbanken","Hintergrundjobs"],"pt":["padrões de desenvolvimento backend","Node.js","estruturas RESTful","segurança backend","autenticação e autorização","acesso a bancos de dados","caching e background jobs"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для backend-разработки","Node.js","RESTful-структуры","безопасность backend","аутентификация и авторизация","доступ к базам данных","кэширование и фоновые задания"],"ar":["نماذج تطوير الخلفية","Node.js","هياكل RESTful","أمان الخلفية","تحقق الهوية و تفويض","وصول إلى قواعد البيانات","caching و مهام الخلفية"]}},"owner":"netkenny1","repo":"Cultura-Cannabica","repoPath":"netkenny1/Cultura-Cannabica","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.498Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-patterns","description":"Backend architecture patterns, API design, Node.js/Express server patterns, security headers, rate limiting, and server-side best practices. Use when building or modifying server.js, API routes, or backend logic.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Development Patterns\n\nBackend patterns for Node.js servers (plain http, Express, or similar) and scalable server-side logic.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Designing or changing API structure\n- Adding or modifying server.js (or Express) routes and middleware\n- Implementing rate limiting, security headers, or error handling\n- Database access, caching, or background jobs\n- Authentication, authorization, or input validation\n\n---\n\n## API Design\n\n### RESTful Structure\n\n- Resource-based URLs: `GET/POS","body":"# Backend Development Patterns\n\nBackend patterns for Node.js servers (plain http, Express, or similar) and scalable server-side logic.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Designing or changing API structure\n- Adding or modifying server.js (or Express) routes and middleware\n- Implementing rate limiting, security headers, or error handling\n- Database access, caching, or background jobs\n- Authentication, authorization, or input validation\n\n---\n\n## API Design\n\n### RESTful Structure\n\n- Resource-based URLs: `GET/POST /api/resources`, `GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE /api/resources/:id`\n- Query params for filtering, sorting, pagination: `?status=active&limit=20&offset=0`\n- Consistent response envelope: `{ success, data?, error?, meta? }`\n\n### Response Envelope\n\n```javascript\n// Success\n{ success: true, data: { ... }, meta?: { total, page, limit } }\n\n// Error\n{ success: false, error: \"message\" }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Node.js Server Patterns\n\n### Security Headers\n\nSet on every response (e.g. in server.js):\n\n- `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`\n- `X-Frame-Options: DENY`\n- `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin`\n- `Content-Security-Policy` (tune for your domains and scripts)\n- `Strict-Transport-Security` in production\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n- Per-IP (or per-user) limits; sliding or fixed window\n- Return 429 with `Retry-After` when exceeded\n- Prefer a single middleware/handler that runs before route logic\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n- Static assets: `Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, immutable` (or similar)\n- HTML/API: `Cache-Control: no-store` or short cache as needed\n\n### MIME Types\n\n- Serve correct `Content-Type` per extension (html, css, js, json, images)\n- Prefer a small map (e.g. `.html` → `text/html; charset=utf-8`) and default to `text/plain` for unknown\n\n---\n\n## Data Access & Business Logic\n\n### Repository Pattern\n\n- Encapsulate data access behind an interface: `findAll`, `findById`, `create`, `update`, `delete`\n- Handlers call the repository; keep HTTP and business logic separate from storage details\n\n### Service Layer\n\n- Put business rules in a service; service uses repository(ies)\n- Keep route handlers thin: validate input → call service → format response\n\n### N+1 Prevention\n\n- Prefer batch loads (e.g. load related entities by ID list) instead of one query per item in a loop\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Validate at boundaries (query, body, headers); fail fast with clear messages\n- Never expose stack traces or internal details to clients\n- Use consistent status codes: 400 validation, 401/403 auth, 404 not found, 429 rate limit, 500 server error\n- Log errors server-side with context (request id, path, user if any)\n\n---\n\n## Security Checklist (Backend)\n\n- No hardcoded secrets; use environment variables and validate at startup\n- All user input validated (length, type, allowlist)\n- Parameterized queries / safe APIs only (no string-concatenated SQL)\n- Rate limiting on all public endpoints\n- Sensitive routes protected (auth/session as needed)\n\nFor full security review flow, use the **security-review** skill when adding auth, payments, or sensitive data.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:16.126Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing scalable server-side logic and API design patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的服务器端逻辑和API设计模式的Node.js代理。","ja":"Node.jsエージェントがスケーラブルなサーバーサイドロジックとAPI設計パターンを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 서버 측 로직과 API 설계 패턴이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Node.js que necesitan lógica de servidor escalable y patrones de diseño de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js ayant besoin d''une logique côté serveur évolutives et de modèles de conception d''API.","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die eine skalierbare Server-Seitenlogik und API-Designmuster benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que necessitam de lógica de servidor escalável e padrões de design de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js, которым необходима масштабируемая логика серверной части и шаблоны проектирования API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Node.js الذين يحتاجون إلى منطق جانب الخادم القابل للتوسيع وأنماط تصميم API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement secure RESTful APIs with rate limiting, security headers, and error handling using Node.js and Express, supporting plain HTTP and similar frameworks.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现安全的RESTful API的能力，具有速率限制、安全头和错误处理，使用Node.js和Express，支持普通HTTP和类似的框架。","ja":"エージェントが安全なRESTful APIを設計して実装する能力を付与します。レート制限、セキュリティヘッダー、エラーハンドリングを使用して、Node.jsとExpressを使用し、平文HTTPや同様のフレームワークをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 보안 RESTful API를 설계하고 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. Node.js와 Express를 사용하여 속도 제한, 보안 헤더 및 오류 처리를 사용하고 평문 HTTP 또는 유사한 프레임워크를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar API RESTful seguras con limitación de velocidad, encabezados de seguridad y control de errores utilizando Node.js y Express, y admitiendo HTTP plano y marcos similares.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des API RESTful sécurisées avec limitation de débit, en-têtes de sécurité et gestion des erreurs en utilisant Node.js et Express, et en prenant en charge le HTTP plain et les frameworks similaires.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, sichere RESTful-APIs mit Rate Limiting, Sicherheitsheadern und Fehlerbehandlung unter Verwendung von Node.js und Express zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, und unterstützt Plain-HTTP und ähnliche Frameworks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem e implementarem APIs RESTful seguras com limite de taxa, cabeçalhos de segurança e tratamento de erros usando Node.js e Express, suportando HTTP simples e frameworks semelhantes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать безопасные RESTful API с ограничением скорости, заголовками безопасности и обработкой ошибок с помощью Node.js и Express, поддерживая простой HTTP и аналогичные фреймворки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وتنفيذ APIs RESTful آمنة مع تحديد معدل وتركيبات أمان ومعالجة الأخطاء باستخدام Node.js و Express، ودعم HTTP البسيط و الإطارات المماثلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing rate limiting and security headers for API endpoints","Designing and modifying RESTful API structures with resource-based URLs","Adding authentication and authorization middleware to server routes"],"zh":["为API端点实现速率限制和安全头","使用基于资源的URL设计和修改RESTful API结构","向服务器路由添加身份验证和授权中间件"],"ja":["APIエンドポイントのレート制限とセキュリティヘッダーの実装","リソースベースのURLを使用したRESTful API構造の設計と変更","サーバー ルートへの認証と認可ミドルウェアの追加"],"ko":["API 엔드포인트에 대한 속도 제한 및 보안 헤더 구현","리소스 기반 URL을 사용한 RESTful API 구조 설계 및 수정","서버 루트에 인증 및 인가 미들웨어 추가"],"es":["Implementar limitación de velocidad y encabezados de seguridad para puntos finales de API","Diseñar y modificar estructuras de API RESTful con URLs basadas en recursos","Agregar middleware de autenticación y autorización a rutas de servidor"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une limitation de débit et des en-têtes de sécurité pour les points de terminaison d''API","Concevoir et modifier des structures d''API RESTful avec des URL basées sur des ressources","Ajouter un middleware d''authentification et d''autorisation aux routes de serveur"],"de":["Implementierung von Rate Limiting und Sicherheitsheadern für API-Endpunkte","Entwerfen und Modifizieren von RESTful-API-Strukturen mit ressourcenbasierten URLs","Hinzufügen von Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsmiddleware zu Server-Routen"],"pt":["Implementação de limitação de taxa e cabeçalhos de segurança para pontos de extremidade de API","Projeto e modificação de estruturas de API RESTful com URLs baseadas em recursos","Adicionando middleware de autenticação e autorização a rotas de servidor"],"ru":["Реализация ограничения скорости и заголовков безопасности для конечных точек API","Проектирование и изменение структур RESTful API с URL-адресами на основе ресурсов","Добавление middleware аутентификации и авторизации к маршрутам сервера"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحديد معدل وتركيبات أمان لنقاط النهاية API","تصميم وتعديل هياكل API RESTful مع عناوين URL القائمة على الموارد","إضافة middleware للتحقق و الإذن إلى مسارات الخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Specific to Node.js servers (plain HTTP, Express, or similar)"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","特定于Node.js服务器（平文HTTP、Express或类似）"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","Node.jsサーバー（平文HTTP、Express、または同様）に特化"],"ko":["Node.js 환경 필요","Node.js 서버(평문 HTTP, Express 또는 유사)에 특화"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Específico para servidores Node.js (HTTP plano, Express o similar)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Spécifique aux serveurs Node.js (HTTP plain, Express ou similaire)"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Node.js-Server (Plain-HTTP, Express oder ähnlich)"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Específico para servidores Node.js (HTTP simples, Express ou semelhantes)"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Конкретно для серверов Node.js (простой HTTP, Express или аналогичные)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدد لمحاكي Node.js (HTTP بسيط، Express أو إطارات مشابهة)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9a23241444bc6fe6e625e15b709cfcc526f7d443fb4470c889af4113e0c545ce","qualityScore":51}');
