es":"FinFocus Dev es una herramienta de línea de comandos para la gestión financiera en entornos Pulumi","fr":"FinFocus Dev est un outil de ligne de commande pour la gestion financière dans les environnements Pulumi","de":"FinFocus Dev ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für die Finanzverwaltung in Pulumi-Umgebungen","pt":"O FinFocus-Dev é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para gerenciamento financeiro em Pulumi","ru":"FinFocus-Dev - это инструмент командной строки для финансового управления в Pulumi","ar":"FinFocus-Dev هو أداة سطر الأوامر للعرض والمدارة المالية في بيئة Pulumi"},"features":{"en":["Builds binary to bin/finfocus using `make build` command","Runs unit tests with `make test` for quick validation","Performs linting with `golangci-lint` and `markdownlint` using `make lint`","Validates setup with `go mod tidy` and `go vet` using `make validate`","Supports race detection with `make test-race` and cross-component tests with `make test-integration`"],"zh":["支持Golang开发","提供CLI命令行工具","包括make build、make test、make lint等命令","支持go mod tidy和go vet","提供跨组件测试功能"],"ja":["Golang開発に対応","CLIコマンドラインツールを提供","make build、make test、make lintなどのコマンドを含む","go mod tidyとgo vetをサポート","クロスコンポーネントテスト機能を提供"],"ko":["Golang 개발 지원","CLI 명령어 제공","make build, make test, make lint 등의 명령어 포함","go mod tidy와 go vet 지원","크로스 컴포넌트 테스트 기능 제공"],"es":["Compilación de binarios con `make build`","Pruebas unitarias con `make test`","Validación de código con `make lint` y `make validate`","Pruebas de integración con `make test-integration`","Detección de carreras con `make test-race`"],"fr":["Compilation de binaires avec `make build`","Tests unitaires avec `make test`","Validation de code avec `make lint` et `make validate`","Tests d''intégration avec `make test-integration`","Détection de courses avec `make test-race`"],"de":["Kompilierung von Binärdateien mit `make build`","Einheitliche Tests mit `make test`","Validierung von Code mit `make lint` und `make validate`","Integrations-tests mit `make test-integration`","Renn-Detektion mit `make test-race`"],"pt":["Suporte a build e testes com make","Integração com golangci-lint e markdownlint","Validação com go mod tidy e go vet","Detecção de corridas com make test-race","Testes de integração com make test-integration"],"ru":["Поддержка сборки и тестирования с make","Интеграция с golangci-lint и markdownlint","Валидация с go mod tidy и go vet","Обнаружение гонок с make test-race","Тесты интеграции с make test-integration"],"ar":["دعم الإنشاء والاختبار مع make","التكامل مع golangci-lint و markdownlint","التحقق من الصحة مع go mod tidy و go vet","كشف السباقات مع make test-race","اختبارات التكامل مع make test-integration"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use finfocus-dev","finfocus-dev setup guide","Pulumi environment financial management","finfocus-dev alternative","finfocus-dev vs pulumi","finfocus-dev install","what is finfocus-dev","finfocus-dev documentation","finfocus-dev tutorial"],"zh":["FinFocus-Dev","Pulumi环境","Golang开发","CLI工具","金融呈现","make build","make test","go mod tidy"],"ja":["FinFocus-Dev","Pulumi環境","Golang開発","CLIツール","金融呈現","make build","make test","go mod tidy","AIエージェント"],"ko":["FinFocus-Dev","Pulumi 환경","Golang 개발","CLI 도구","금융 데이터 관리","make build","make test","go mod tidy","AI 도구"],"es":["FinFocus Dev","Pulumi","CLI","gestión financiera","compilación de binarios","pruebas unitarias","validación de código","herramientas de desarrollo","entornos de desarrollo"],"fr":["FinFocus Dev","Pulumi","CLI","gestion financière","compilation de binaires","tests unitaires","validation de code","outils de développement","environnements de développement"],"de":["FinFocus Dev","Pulumi","CLI","Finanzverwaltung","Kompilierung von Binärdateien","Einheitliche Tests","Validierung von Code","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["FinFocus-Dev","CLI para gerenciamento financeiro","Pulumi","make","golangci-lint","markdownlint","go mod tidy","go vet","testes de integração"],"ru":["FinFocus-Dev","ИИ Агенты для финансового управления","Pulumi","make","golangci-lint","markdownlint","go mod tidy","go vet","тесты интеграции"],"ar":["FinFocus-Dev","واجهة سطر الأوامر للعرض والمدارة المالية","Pulumi","make","golangci-lint","markdownlint","go mod tidy","go vet","اختبارات التكامل"]}},"owner":"rshade","repo":"finfocus","repoPath":"rshade/finfocus","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"finfocus-dev","description":">","bodyPreview":"# FinFocus Development Workflow\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\nmake build          # Build binary to bin/finfocus\nmake test           # Unit tests (fast, default)\nmake lint           # golangci-lint + markdownlint (5+ min, use extended timeout)\nmake validate       # go mod tidy + go vet\nmake test-race      # Race detector\nmake test-integration  # Cross-component tests (10min timeout)\nmake build-all      # Build binary + all plugins\n```\n\n**Critical rules**: Always run `make lint` and `make test` be","body":"# FinFocus Development Workflow\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\nmake build          # Build binary to bin/finfocus\nmake test           # Unit tests (fast, default)\nmake lint           # golangci-lint + markdownlint (5+ min, use extended timeout)\nmake validate       # go mod tidy + go vet\nmake test-race      # Race detector\nmake test-integration  # Cross-component tests (10min timeout)\nmake build-all      # Build binary + all plugins\n```\n\n**Critical rules**: Always run `make lint` and `make test` before claiming success.\nNever run `git commit` (user commits manually). Never modify `.golangci.yml`.\n\n## Adding a CLI Command\n\n1. Create `internal/cli/your_command.go`\n1. Follow constructor pattern:\n\n```go\nfunc NewYourCmd() *cobra.Command {\n    var flagVar string\n    cmd := &cobra.Command{\n        Use:   \"your-command\",\n        Short: \"Description\",\n        RunE: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {\n            // Use cmd.Printf() not fmt.Printf()\n            return nil\n        },\n    }\n    cmd.Flags().StringVar(&flagVar, \"flag\", \"\", \"description\")\n    return cmd\n}\n```\n\n1. Register in parent command (e.g., `root.go` or `cost.go`)\n1. Use `RunE` (not `Run`) for error handling\n1. Defer cleanup immediately: `defer cleanup()`\n\n## Resource Processing Pipeline\n\nAll cost commands follow:\n\n```text\ningest.LoadPulumiPlan(path) -> ingest.MapResources() -> registry.Open(ctx, adapter)\n  -> engine.GetProjectedCost/GetActualCost() -> engine.RenderResults(format, results)\n```\n\n## Testing Standards\n\n- Use `testify/assert` and `testify/require` exclusively (never manual `if/t.Errorf`)\n- `require.*` for setup that must succeed; `assert.*` for value checks\n- Table-driven tests for variations\n- Package suffix `_test` for black-box testing\n- `t.TempDir()` for temporary files (auto-cleanup)\n- Capture output: `cmd.SetOut(&buf)` and `cmd.SetErr(&buf)`\n- Target 80% coverage minimum, 95% for critical paths\n\nSee [references/testing-patterns.md](references/testing-patterns.md) for detailed\ntest patterns and examples.\n\n## Project Structure\n\nSee [references/project-structure.md](references/project-structure.md) for the\ncomplete package map and key file locations.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Wrap errors: `fmt.Errorf(\"context: %w\", err)`\n- Return early on errors\n- Plugin failures don''t stop processing (graceful degradation)\n- Validation prefix: `\"VALIDATION: %v\"`, plugin error prefix: `\"ERROR:\"`\n\n## Logging (zerolog)\n\n```go\nlog := logging.FromContext(ctx)\nlog.Debug().Ctx(ctx).Str(\"component\", \"engine\").Msg(\"message\")\n```\n\nStandard fields: `trace_id`, `component`, `operation`, `duration_ms`.\nEnable debug: `--debug` flag or `FINFOCUS_LOG_LEVEL=debug`.\n\n## Date Handling\n\nSupport both `\"2006-01-02\"` and RFC3339. Default `--to` to `time.Now()`.\nValidate ranges (to must be after from).\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThree formats via `--output` flag: `table` (default), `json`, `ndjson`.\nAlways use `cmd.Printf()` for testability.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:52.505Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced Pulumi environment management and financial presentation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Pulumi 环境管理和金融演示能力的金融分析代理。","ja":"高度な Pulumi 環境管理と金融プレゼンテーション機能が必要な金融分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Pulumi 환경 관리와 재무 프레젠테이션 기능이 필요한 재무 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan una gestión avanzada del entorno Pulumi y capacidades de presentación financiera.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse financière ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée de l''environnement Pulumi et de capacités de présentation financière.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyseagenten, die eine erweiterte Pulumi-Umgebungverwaltung und Finanzpräsentationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de ambiente Pulumi e capacidades de apresentação financeira.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым требуется продвинутый менеджмент среды Pulumi и финансовые возможности презентации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحليل المالي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة للبيئة Pulumi وقدرات العرض المالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build, test, and validate financial setups using a range of commands, including make build, make test, and make validate, leveraging golangci-lint and go mod tidy for comprehensive validation.","zh":"赋予代理构建、测试和验证金融设置的能力，使用一系列命令，包括 make build、make test 和 make validate，利用 golangci-lint 和 go mod tidy 进行全面验证。","ja":"エージェントが金融設定を構築、テスト、検証する能力を与えます。make build、make test、make validate などのコマンドを使用し、golangci-lint と go mod tidy を使用して包括的な検証を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 재무 설정을構築、테스트 및検証할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. make build, make test, make validateなどの 명령을 사용하여 golangci-lint와 go mod tidy를 활용한 포괄적인 검증을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, probar y validar configuraciones financieras utilizando una variedad de comandos, incluyendo make build, make test y make validate, aprovechando golangci-lint y go mod tidy para una validación integral.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de tester et de valider les configurations financières à l''aide d''une gamme de commandes, notamment make build, make test et make validate, en exploitant golangci-lint et go mod tidy pour une validation complète.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Finanzkonfigurationen mithilfe einer Reihe von Befehlen zu erstellen, zu testen und zu überprüfen, einschließlich make build, make test und make validate, und nutzt golangci-lint und go mod tidy für eine umfassende Überprüfung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir, testar e validar configurações financeiras usando uma variedade de comandos, incluindo make build, make test e make validate, utilizando golangci-lint e go mod tidy para validação abrangente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, тестировать и проверять финансовые настройки с помощью различных команд, включая make build, make test и make validate, используя golangci-lint и go mod tidy для всесторонней проверки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء وتجريب وتصديق التكوينات المالية باستخدام مجموعة من الأوامر، بما في ذلك make build و make test و make validate، باستخدام golangci-lint و go mod tidy للتحقق الشامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating financial presentation and management tasks","Validating financial setups with make validate and go vet","Building and testing financial binaries with make build and make test"],"zh":["自动化金融演示和管理任务","使用 make validate 和 go vet 验证金融设置","使用 make build 和 make test 构建和测试金融二进制文件"],"ja":["金融プレゼンテーションと管理タスクの自動化","make validate と go vet を使用した金融設定の検証","make build と make test を使用した金融バイナリの構築とテスト"],"ko":["재무 프레젠테이션 및 관리 작업 자동화","make validate 및 go vet를 사용한 재무 설정 검증","make build 및 make test를 사용한 재무 바이너리 빌드 및 테스트"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de presentación y gestión financieras","Validar configuraciones financieras con make validate y go vet","Crear y probar binarios financieros con make build y make test"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de présentation et de gestion financières","Valider les configurations financières avec make validate et go vet","Créer et tester les binaires financiers avec make build et make test"],"de":["Automatisieren von Finanzpräsentations- und Managementaufgaben","Validieren von Finanzkonfigurationen mit make validate und go vet","Erstellen und Testen von Finanzbinärdateien mit make build und make test"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de apresentação e gerenciamento financeiro","Validar configurações financeiras com make validate e go vet","Construir e testar binários financeiros com make build e make test"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач финансовой презентации и управления","Проверка финансовых настроек с помощью make validate и go vet","Создание и тестирование финансовых бинарных файлов с помощью make build и make test"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في مهام العرض والمعالجة المالية","التحقق من التكوينات المالية باستخدام make validate و go vet","بناء وتجريب الثنائيات المالية باستخدام make build و make test"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pulumi environment setup","Limited to financial presentation and management tasks","Dependent on make and golangci-lint for build and validation processes"],"zh":["需要 Pulumi 环境设置","仅限金融演示和管理任务","依赖 make 和 golangci-lint 进行构建和验证过程"],"ja":["Pulumi 環境設定が必要","金融プレゼンテーションと管理タスクのみ","make と golangci-lint に依存した構築と検証プロセス"],"ko":["Pulumi 환경 설정이 필요합니다.","재무 프레젠테이션 및 관리 작업만 해당","make 및 golangci-lint에 의존한 빌드 및 검증 프로세스"],"es":["Requiere configuración del entorno Pulumi","Limitado a tareas de presentación y gestión financieras","Dependiente de make y golangci-lint para los procesos de compilación y validación"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''environnement Pulumi","Limité aux tâches de présentation et de gestion financières","Dépendant de make et golangci-lint pour les processus de construction et de validation"],"de":["Benötigt Pulumi-Umgebungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Finanzpräsentations- und Managementaufgaben","Abhängig von make und golangci-lint für Build- und Validierungsprozesse"],"pt":["Requer configuração de ambiente Pulumi","Limitado a tarefas de apresentação e gerenciamento financeiro","Dependente de make e golangci-lint para processos de compilação e validação"],"ru":["Требуется настройка среды Pulumi","Ограничен задачами финансовой презентации и управления","Зависит от make и golangci-lint для процессов сборки и проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة Pulumi","محدود بمهام العرض والمعالجة المالية","يعتمد على make و golangci-lint لعملية البناء والتحقق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1050581098f50c06be488033a630bcb4abf850ecd07296b1afac9bf99481ffa1","qualityScore":51}');
