herramienta de AI que automatiza la implementación de aplicaciones","fr":"release-app est un outil d''IA qui automatise le déploiement d''applications","de":"release-app ist ein AI-Tool, das die Bereitstellung von Anwendungen automatisiert","pt":"O que é release-app? Uma ferramenta de distribuição de aplicações macOS simples e eficaz","ru":"Что такое release-app? Простой и эффективный инструмент для распространения приложений macOS для ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو release-app؟ أداة توزيع تطبيقات macOS بسيطة وفعالة لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Extracts version strings from filenames in the format Caffee-v{VERSION}.app","Verifies the existence of apps at provided paths","Renames apps to Caffee.app for consistency","Supports macOS 14+ (Sonoma) and later versions","Utilizes Swift for native macOS compatibility","Follows a specific filename format for version extraction"],"zh":["版本提取功能，支持 Caffee-v{VERSION}.app 格式","应用验证功能，检查应用路径是否存在","应用重命名功能，支持将应用重命名为 Caffee.app","支持 macOS 14+ Sonoma","使用 Swift 编写"],"ja":["バージョン抽出機能、Caffee-v{VERSION}.app フォーマット対応","アプリの検証機能、アプリパスの存在を確認","アプリのリネーム機能、Caffee.app へのリネーム対応","macOS 14+ Sonoma 対応","Swift で書かれています"],"ko":["버전 추출 기능, Caffee-v{VERSION}.app 형식 지원","애플리케이션 검증 기능, 애플리케이션 경로 존재 여부 확인","애플리케이션 이름 변경 기능, Caffee.app으로의 이름 변경 지원","macOS 14+ Sonoma 지원","Swift로 작성됨"],"es":["Extracción de versiones de archivos de aplicación","Verificación de la existencia de la ruta de aplicación","Renombramiento de aplicaciones a Caffee.app","Compatibilidad con macOS 14+ Sonoma","Desarrollado con Swift"],"fr":["Extraction de versions de fichiers d''application","Vérification de l''existence du chemin d''application","Renommage d''applications en Caffee.app","Compatibilité avec macOS 14+ Sonoma","Développé avec Swift"],"de":["Extraktion von Versionen aus Anwendungsdateien","Überprüfung der Existenz des Anwendungs-pfads","Umbenennung von Anwendungen in Caffee.app","Kompatibilität mit macOS 14+ Sonoma","Entwickelt mit Swift"],"pt":["Extração de versão do nome do arquivo","Verificação da existência do aplicativo","Renomeação do aplicativo para Caffee.app","Suporte a macOS 14+ Sonoma","Desenvolvido em Swift"],"ru":["Извлечение версии из имени файла","Проверка существования приложения","Переименование приложения в Caffee.app","Поддержка macOS 14+ Sonoma","Написано на Swift для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["استخراج الإصدار من اسم الملف","تأكيد وجود التطبيق","إعادة تسمية التطبيق إلى Caffee.app","دعم macOS 14+ Sonoma","مكتوب بلغة Swift لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release-app","release-app setup guide","macOS app deployment automation","release-app alternative","release-app vs manual deployment","automated app release for macOS","release-app install","what is release-app","release-app for developers","macOS 14+ app release"],"zh":["Release-App","macOS 应用发布工具","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","版本提取","应用验证","应用重命名","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Release-App","macOS用AIエージェント","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","バージョン抽出","アプリの検証","アプリのリネーム","AIツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Release-App","macOS용 AI 도구","Swift","macOS 14+ Sonoma","버전 추출","애플리케이션 검증","애플리케이션 이름 변경","AI 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["release-app","implementación de aplicaciones","extracción de versiones","verificación de rutas de aplicación","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","herramientas de AI","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["release-app","déploiement d''applications","extraction de versions","vérification de chemins d''application","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","outils d''IA","développement d''applications"],"de":["release-app","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Extraktion von Versionen","Überprüfung von Anwendungs-pfaden","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","AI-Tools","Anwendungs-entwicklung"],"pt":["release-app","distribuição de aplicações macOS","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","desenvolvimento de aplicações","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","configuração do release-app"],"ru":["release-app","распространение приложений macOS","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","разработка приложений","инструменты разработки","настройка release-app","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["release-app","توزيع تطبيقات macOS","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Swift","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات التطوير","إعداد release-app","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"khanhicetea","repo":"Caffee","repoPath":"khanhicetea/Caffee","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.601Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-app","description":"Automate the release process for Caffee app.","bodyPreview":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app","body":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app to `Caffee.app` in the same directory\n   - This ensures consistent naming when users install the app\n   - Example: `cp -R ~/Documents/Caffee-v1.18.0 ~/Documents/Caffee.app`\n\n4. **Create DMG**\n   - Run: `create-dmg Caffee.app .` (use the renamed Caffee.app)  (use which for get path)\n   - This creates a DMG in the current directory\n   - Rename the output to `Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg`)\n   - Clean up: remove the temporary Caffee.app copy\n\n5. **Sign the DMG**\n   - Run: `sign_update Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (use which for get path)\n   - Capture the output which contains:\n     - `sparkle:edSignature=\"...\"`\n     - `length=\"...\"`\n   - Parse and extract the signature and file size\n\n6. **Get file size and checksum**\n   - Get file size: `stat -f%z Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Get SHA256 checksum: `shasum -a 256 Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n7. **Update web/appcast.xml**\n   - Add a new `<item>` element at the top of the channel (before existing items)\n   - Use current date in RFC 2822 format for pubDate\n   - The download URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Include the signature and length from sign_update output\n   - If release notes provided, use them; otherwise generate from git log since previous version\n   - the <sparkle:version> should be integer, e.g., 11901 (1.19.1 => 1*10000 + 19*100 + 1)\n\n8. **Update web/index.html**\n   - Update the download button version text and link\n   - Add new release notes entry in the Release Notes section with checksum\n   - Release notes (changelogs) translate into Vietnamese\n\n9. **Update web/download.html**\n   - Update the meta refresh URL to point to the new DMG release\n   - Update the direct download link in the body\n   - URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n10. **Summary**\n   - Show summary of what was done\n   - Show the DMG path for upload to GitHub\n   - Remind user to:\n     - Upload DMG to GitHub releases at the tag `{VERSION}`\n     - Deploy updated web files\n\n## Example appcast.xml item format\n\n```xml\n<item>\n  <title>Version 1.18.0</title>\n  <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>\n  <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>\n  <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0700</pubDate>\n  <enclosure\n    url=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    sparkle:edSignature=\"SIGNATURE_HERE\"\n    length=\"12345678\"\n    type=\"application/octet-stream\"\n  />\n  <description><![CDATA[\n    <h2>What''s New</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n  ]]></description>\n</item>\n```\n\n## Example index.html updates\n\nDownload button (around line 64):\n```html\n<button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"location.href=''/download.html?v=1.18.0''\">\n    Tải app tại đây (v1.18.0)\n</button>\n```\n\nRelease notes section (after line 240):\n```html\n<div>\n    <h5>v1.18.0</h5>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Checksum sha256 (Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg) :\n            <code>CHECKSUM_HERE</code>\n        </li>\n        <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Example download.html updates\n\nMeta refresh tag (line 9):\n```html\n<meta\n    http-equiv=\"refresh\"\n    content=\"2; URL=https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n/>\n```\n\nDirect download link (line 24):\n```html\n<a\n    href=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    >bấm vào đây để tải ngay</a\n>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:40.241Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for macOS Development Agents seeking to automate app deployment tasks with filename version extraction and app existence verification.","zh":"适用于 macOS 开发代理，旨在使用文件名版本提取和应用程序存在验证自动执行应用程序部署任务。","ja":"macOS 開発エージェントがアプリケーションのデプロイタスクを自動化するために、ファイル名バージョン抽出とアプリケーションの存在検証を使用して、アプリケーションをデプロイするタスクを自動化するために最適です。","ko":"macOS 개발 에이전트가 파일 이름 버전 추출 및 애플리케이션 존재 확인을 사용하여 애플리케이션 배포 작업을 자동화하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de macOS que buscan automatizar tareas de implementación de aplicaciones con extracción de versión de nombres de archivo y verificación de existencia de aplicaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement macOS souhaitant automatiser les tâches de déploiement d''applications avec extraction de version de noms de fichier et vérification d''existence d''applications.","de":"Ideal für macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die Aufgaben zur App-Veröffentlichung automatisieren möchten, einschließlich Dateinamensversionsextraktion und App-Existenzüberprüfung.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do macOS que buscam automatizar tarefas de implantação de aplicativos com extração de versão de nome de arquivo e verificação de existência de aplicativo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке macOS, стремящихся автоматизировать задачи развертывания приложений с помощью извлечения версии имени файла и проверки существования приложения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير macOS يسعى إلى توفير مهام نشر التطبيقات باستخدام استخراج إصدار اسم الملف وتأكيد وجود التطبيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline app release processes by extracting version strings from filenames, verifying app existence, and renaming apps to a standardized format, utilizing filepath manipulation and version string parsing.","zh":"赋予代理人通过从文件名中提取版本字符串、验证应用程序存在和将应用程序重命名为标准格式来简化应用程序发布流程的能力，利用文件路径操作和版本字符串解析。","ja":"エージェントはファイル名からバージョン文字列を抽出し、アプリケーションの存在を確認し、アプリケーションを標準形式に名前を変更することで、アプリケーションのリリースプロセスを合理化することができます。ファイルパス操作とバージョン文字列の解析を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 이름에서 버전 문자열을 추출하고, 애플리케이션 존재를 확인하고, 애플리케이션을 표준 형식으로 이름을 변경하여 애플리케이션 릴리스 프로세스를 간소화할 수 있도록启用합니다. 파일 경로 조작 및 버전 문자열 구문을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar los procesos de publicación de aplicaciones extrayendo cadenas de versión de nombres de archivo, verificando la existencia de aplicaciones y renombrando aplicaciones a un formato estandarizado, utilizando la manipulación de ruta de archivo y el análisis de cadenas de versión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser les processus de publication d''applications en extrayant des chaînes de version de noms de fichiers, en vérifiant l''existence d''applications et en renommant des applications dans un format standardisé, en utilisant la manipulation de chemin de fichier et l''analyse de chaîne de version.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die App-Veröffentlichungsprozesse zu optimieren, indem Versionszeichenfolgen aus Dateinamen extrahiert, die Existenz von Apps überprüft und Apps in ein standardisiertes Format umbenannt werden, unter Verwendung der Dateipfadmanipulation und der Versionss Zeichenfolgenanalyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem os processos de lançamento de aplicativos, extrair cordas de versão de nomes de arquivos, verificar a existência do aplicativo e renomear aplicativos para um formato padrão, utilizando manipulação de caminho de arquivo e análise de corda de versão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать процессы выпуска приложений, извлекая строки версий из имен файлов, проверяя существование приложения и переименовывая приложения в стандартизированный формат, используя манипуляцию файловым путем и разбор строки версии.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من تسهيل عمليات إصدار التطبيقات من خلال استخراج السلاسل الإصدارية من أسماء الملفات، وتأكيد وجود التطبيق، وإعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق معياري، باستخدام مаниبولات مسار الملف وتحليل السلسلة الإصدارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating app release tasks for macOS developers","Extracting version information from app filenames","Renaming apps to a standardized format for deployment"],"zh":["为macOS开发者自动执行应用程序发布任务","从应用程序文件名中提取版本信息","将应用程序重命名为标准格式以进行部署"],"ja":["macOS開発者向けのアプリケーションのリリースタスクを自動化する","アプリケーションのファイル名からバージョン情報を抽出する","アプリケーションを標準形式に名前を変更してデプロイする"],"ko":["macOS 개발자를 위한 애플리케이션 릴리스 작업 자동화","애플리케이션 파일 이름에서 버전 정보 추출","배포를 위한 애플리케이션 표준 형식으로 이름 변경"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de publicación de aplicaciones para desarrolladores de macOS","Extraer información de versión de nombres de archivo de aplicaciones","Renombrar aplicaciones a un formato estandarizado para la implementación"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de publication d''applications pour les développeurs macOS","Extraire des informations de version de noms de fichiers d''applications","Renommer des applications dans un format standardisé pour le déploiement"],"de":["Automatisieren von App-Veröffentlichungsaufgaben für macOS-Entwickler","Extrahieren von Versionsinformationen aus App-Dateinamen","Umbenennen von Apps in ein standardisiertes Format für die Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de lançamento de aplicativos para desenvolvedores macOS","Extrair informações de versão de nomes de arquivos de aplicativos","Renomear aplicativos para um formato padrão para implantação"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач выпуска приложений для разработчиков macOS","Извлечение информации о версии из имен файлов приложений","Переименование приложений в стандартизированный формат для развертывания"],"ar":["توفير مهام إصدار التطبيقات للعملاء تطوير macOS","استخراج معلومات الإصدار من أسماء ملفات التطبيقات","إعادة تسمية التطبيقات إلى تنسيق معياري لنشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS environment","Specific app filename format required (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"zh":["需要macOS环境","需要特定的应用程序文件名格式（Caffee-v{VERSION}.app）"],"ja":["macOS環境が必要","特定のアプリケーションファイル名形式（Caffee-v{VERSION}.app）が必要"],"ko":["macOS 환경 필요","특정 애플리케이션 파일 이름 형식(Caffee-v{VERSION}.app) 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de macOS","Se requiere un formato de nombre de archivo de aplicación específico (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement macOS","Un format de nom de fichier d''application spécifique est requis (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"de":["Benötigt eine macOS-Umgebung","Ein spezifisches App-Dateinamenformat ist erforderlich (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente macOS","Formato de nome de arquivo de aplicativo específico necessário (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"ru":["Требуется среда macOS","Требуется специфический формат имени файла приложения (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة macOS","مطلوب تنسيق مخصص لاسم ملف التطبيق (Caffee-v{VERSION}.app)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"da33f480e83f445743b747f591fa0ae23bbbc90f0144a7f6fe0295429c1bb4ac","qualityScore":51}');
