スのモバイルアプリを作成する方法","ko":"Flutter 개발은 Dart 언어와 위젯 구성으로 고성능 모바일 애플리케이션을 생성하는 방법입니다.","es":"Flutter es un framework de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que utiliza el lenguaje Dart para crear aplicaciones de alto rendimiento","fr":"Flutter est un framework de développement d''applications mobiles qui utilise le langage Dart pour créer des applications performantes","de":"Flutter ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung von Mobile Apps, das die Sprache Dart verwendet, um hochleistungsfähige Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Desenvolvimento Flutter é uma tecnologia de criação de aplicativos móveis que usa Dart para criar interfaces visuais personalizadas.","ru":"Развитие Flutter - это технология создания мобильных приложений, которая использует Dart для создания индивидуальных визуальных интерфейсов для ИИ Агентов.","ar":"تطوير Flutter هو تقنية لإنشاء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول التي تستخدم Dart لإنشاء واجهات مرئية مخصصة لآلة الإيضاح"},"features":{"en":["Mastering widget composition with Flutter''s widget system","Implementing state management patterns for complex applications","Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system","Rapid app development with hot reload","Creating consistent UX across iOS and Android platforms","Implementing complex animations and visual effects"],"zh":["使用 Dart 语言创建移动应用","Widget 组合和状态管理模式","导航和 API 集成","热重载和快速应用开发","跨平台的一致性 UX"],"ja":["Dart 言語を使用したモバイルアプリの作成","ウィジェットの組み合わせとステート管理パターン","ナビゲーションと API 統合","ホットリロードと迅速なアプリ開発","クロスプラットフォームの一貫性 UX"],"ko":["Dart 언어를 사용한 모바일 애플리케이션 생성","위젯 구성과 상태 관리 패턴","навигация와 API 통합","핫 리로드와 빠른 애플리케이션 개발","크로스 플랫폼 일관성 UX"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones móviles con rendimiento nativo","Diseño de interfaces de usuario personalizadas con el sistema de widgets de Flutter","Implementación de animaciones y efectos visuales complejos","Desarrollo de aplicaciones rápidas con recarga en caliente","Creación de experiencias de usuario consistentes en varias plataformas"],"fr":["Création d''applications mobiles avec des performances natives","Conception d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées avec le système de widgets Flutter","Mise en œuvre d''animations et d''effets visuels complexes","Développement d''applications rapides avec rechargement à chaud","Création d''expériences utilisateur cohérentes sur plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Erstellung von Mobile Apps mit nativer Leistung","Entwurf von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen mit dem Flutter-Widget-System","Implementierung von komplexen Animationen und visuellen Effekten","Schnelle Entwicklung von Apps mit Hot-Reload","Erstellung von konsistenten Benutzererfahrungen auf mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos móveis de alto desempenho com Dart","Composição de widgets personalizados","Padrões de gerenciamento de estado avançados","Integração de API para serviços de backend","Animações e efeitos visuais complexos","Desenvolvimento rápido com hot reload"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных мобильных приложений с помощью Dart для ИИ Агентов","Состав индивидуальных виджетов","Шаблоны управления состоянием","Интеграция API для сервисов бэкенда","Сложные анимации и визуальные эффекты","Быстрое развитие с помощью hot reload"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول عالية الأداء باستخدام Dart لآلة الإيضاح","تركيبات Widgets مخصصة","نمط إدارة الحالة المتقدم","تكامل API لخدمات الخلفية","الرسوم المتحركة والتأثيرات البصرية المعقدة","التطوير السريع مع إعادة التحميل السريع"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use flutter development","what is flutter development","flutter development setup guide","flutter development vs react native","flutter development install","flutter development tutorial for beginners","flutter development alternative","flutter development best practices"],"zh":["Flutter 开发","Dart 语言","移动应用开发","Widget 组合","状态管理","导航和 API 集成","热重载","快速应用开发","跨平台开发"],"ja":["Flutter 開発","Dart 言語","モバイルアプリ開発","ウィジェットの組み合わせ","ステート管理","ナビゲーションと API 統合","ホットリロード","迅速なアプリ開発","クロスプラットフォーム開発"],"ko":["Flutter 개발","Dart 언어","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","위젯 구성","상태 관리","навигация와 API 통합","핫 리로드","빠른 애플리케이션 개발","크로스 플랫폼 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Flutter","Dart","aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento","gestión de estado en Flutter","integración de API en Flutter","widgets en Flutter","animaciones en Flutter"],"fr":["développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter","Dart","applications mobiles performantes","gestion d''état dans Flutter","intégration d''API dans Flutter","widgets dans Flutter","animations dans Flutter"],"de":["Entwicklung von Mobile Apps","Flutter","Dart","hochleistungsfähige Mobile Apps","Statusverwaltung in Flutter","API-Integration in Flutter","Widgets in Flutter","Animationen in Flutter"],"pt":["desenvolvimento flutter","aplicativos móveis de alto desempenho","dart","composição de widgets","gerenciamento de estado","integração de api","animações e efeitos visuais","desenvolvimento rápido","hot reload"],"ru":["развитие flutter","высокопроизводительные мобильные приложения","dart","состав виджетов","шаблоны управления состоянием","интеграция api","сложные анимации и визуальные эффекты","быстрое развитие","hot reload","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تطوير flutter","تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول عالية الأداء","dart","تركيبات widgets","نمط إدارة الحالة","تكامل api","الرسوم المتحركة والتأثيرات البصرية المعقدة","التطوير السريع","إعادة التحميل السريع","آلة الإيضاح"]}},"owner":"ddcq","repo":"personal-oracle","repoPath":"ddcq/personal-oracle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.601Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-development","description":"Build beautiful cross-platform mobile apps with Flutter and Dart. Covers widgets, state management with Provider/BLoC, navigation, API integration, and material design.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n##","body":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **Project Structure & Navigation**\n\n```dart\n// pubspec.yaml\nname: my_flutter_app\nversion: 1.0.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  provider: ^6.0.0\n  http: ^1.1.0\n  go_router: ^12.0.0\n\n// main.dart with GoRouter navigation\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:go_router/go_router.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  runApp(const MyApp());\n}\n\nclass MyApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyApp({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return MaterialApp.router(\n      title: ''Flutter App'',\n      theme: ThemeData(primarySwatch: Colors.blue, useMaterial3: true),\n      routerConfig: _router,\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nfinal GoRouter _router = GoRouter(\n  routes: <RouteBase>[\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const HomeScreen(),\n      routes: [\n        GoRoute(\n          path: ''details/:id'',\n          builder: (context, state) => DetailsScreen(\n            itemId: state.pathParameters[''id'']!\n          ),\n        ),\n      ],\n    ),\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/profile'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const ProfileScreen(),\n    ),\n  ],\n);\n```\n\n### 2. **State Management with Provider**\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:http/http.dart'' as http;\nimport ''dart:convert'';\n\nclass User {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  final String email;\n\n  User({required this.id, required this.name, required this.email});\n\n  factory User.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {\n    return User(\n      id: json[''id''],\n      name: json[''name''],\n      email: json[''email''],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass UserProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  User? _user;\n  bool _isLoading = false;\n  String? _error;\n\n  User? get user => _user;\n  bool get isLoading => _isLoading;\n  String? get error => _error;\n\n  Future<void> fetchUser(String userId) async {\n    _isLoading = true;\n    _error = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/users/$userId''),\n        headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _user = User.fromJson(jsonDecode(response.body));\n      } else {\n        _error = ''Failed to fetch user'';\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      _error = ''Error: ${e.toString()}'';\n    } finally {\n      _isLoading = false;\n      notifyListeners();\n    }\n  }\n\n  void logout() {\n    _user = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemsProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> _items = [];\n\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> get items => _items;\n\n  Future<void> fetchItems() async {\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/items''),\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _items = List<Map<String, dynamic>>.from(\n          jsonDecode(response.body) as List\n        );\n        notifyListeners();\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      print(''Error fetching items: $e'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Screens with Provider Integration**\n\n```dart\nclass HomeScreen extends StatefulWidget {\n  const HomeScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  State<HomeScreen> createState() => _HomeScreenState();\n}\n\nclass _HomeScreenState extends State<HomeScreen> {\n  @override\n  void initState() {\n    super.initState();\n    Future.microtask(() {\n      Provider.of<ItemsProvider>(context, listen: false).fetchItems();\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Home Feed'')),\n      body: Consumer<ItemsProvider>(\n        builder: (context, itemsProvider, child) {\n          if (itemsProvider.items.isEmpty) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No items found''));\n          }\n          return ListView.builder(\n            itemCount: itemsProvider.items.length,\n            itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n              final item = itemsProvider.items[index];\n              return ItemCard(item: item);\n            },\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemCard extends StatelessWidget {\n  final Map<String, dynamic> item;\n\n  const ItemCard({required this.item, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Card(\n      margin: const EdgeInsets.all(8),\n      child: ListTile(\n        title: Text(item[''title''] ?? ''Untitled''),\n        subtitle: Text(item[''description''] ?? ''''),\n        trailing: const Icon(Icons.arrow_forward),\n        onTap: () => context.go(''/details/${item[''id'']}''),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass DetailsScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  final String itemId;\n\n  const DetailsScreen({required this.itemId, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Details'')),\n      body: Center(\n        child: Column(\n          mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,\n          children: [\n            Text(''Item ID: $itemId'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n            const SizedBox(height: 16),\n            ElevatedButton(\n              onPressed: () => context.pop(),\n              child: const Text(''Go Back''),\n            ),\n          ],\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ProfileScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  const ProfileScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Profile'')),\n      body: Consumer<UserProvider>(\n        builder: (context, userProvider, child) {\n          if (userProvider.isLoading) {\n            return const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());\n          }\n          if (userProvider.error != null) {\n            return Center(child: Text(''Error: ${userProvider.error}''));\n          }\n          final user = userProvider.user;\n          if (user == null) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No user data''));\n          }\n          return Padding(\n            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(16),\n            child: Column(\n              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n              children: [\n                Text(''Name: ${user.name}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n                Text(''Email: ${user.email}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 16)),\n                const SizedBox(height: 16),\n                ElevatedButton(\n                  onPressed: () => userProvider.logout(),\n                  child: const Text(''Logout''),\n                ),\n              ],\n            ),\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Use widgets for every UI element\n- Implement proper state management\n- Use const constructors where possible\n- Dispose resources in state lifecycle\n- Test on multiple device sizes\n- Use meaningful widget names\n- Implement error handling\n- Use responsive design patterns\n- Test on both iOS and Android\n- Document custom widgets\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Build entire screens in build() method\n- Use setState for complex state logic\n- Make network calls in build()\n- Ignore platform differences\n- Create overly nested widget trees\n- Hardcode strings\n- Ignore performance warnings\n- Skip testing\n- Forget to handle edge cases\n- Deploy without thorough testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:42.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents requiring native performance and cross-platform compatibility with Dart language expertise.","zh":"适用于需要原生性能和跨平台兼容性的移动应用代理，要求具备Dart语言专业知识。","ja":"Dart言語の専門知識を備えた、ネイティブパフォーマンスとクロスプラットフォームの互換性を必要とするモバイルアプリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Dart 언어 전문 지식을 갖춘 네이티브 성능과 크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 요구하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren rendimiento nativo y compatibilidad entre plataformas con experiencia en el lenguaje Dart.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles nécessitant des performances natives et une compatibilité multi-plateformes avec une expertise en langage Dart.","de":"Ideal für Mobile App-Agents, die natives Leistungsvermögen und Cross-Plattform-Kompatibilität mit Dart-Sprachkenntnissen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que exigem desempenho nativo e compatibilidade entre plataformas com especialização em linguagem Dart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих родной производительности и кроссплатформенной совместимости с опытом работы с языком Dart.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيقات المحمولة التي تتطلب الأداء الأصلي والتوافق بين المنصات باستخدام خبرة لغة Dart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter, mastering widget composition, state management patterns, and API integration with Dart, enabling rapid app development and consistent UX across platforms.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Flutter、掌握小部件组合、状态管理模式和Dart的API集成，创建高性能、视觉效果惊人的移动应用的能力，实现跨平台的快速应用开发和一致的用户体验。","ja":"Flutterを使用して、高パフォーマンスで視覚的に惊くべきモバイルアプリケーションを作成する能力をエージェントに与え、Dartのウィジェットの構成、状態管理パターン、API統合をマスターし、プラットフォーム間で迅速なアプリ開発と一貫したUXを実現します。","ko":"Flutter를 사용하여 고성능의 시각적으로 놀라운 모바일 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하고, Dart의 위젯 구성, 상태 관리 패턴, API 통합을 마스터하여 플랫폼 간에 빠른 앱 개발과 일관된 UX를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento y visualmente impresionantes utilizando Flutter, dominando la composición de widgets, patrones de gestión de estado y la integración de API con Dart, lo que permite un desarrollo de aplicaciones rápido y una experiencia del usuario coherente en todas las plataformas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications mobiles à haute performance et visuellement époustouflantes en utilisant Flutter, en maîtrisant la composition de widgets, les modèles de gestion d''état et l''intégration d''API avec Dart, ce qui permet un développement d''applications rapide et une expérience utilisateur cohérente sur toutes les plateformes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochleistungsstarke und visuell ansprechende Mobile Apps mit Flutter zu erstellen, indem sie die Zusammensetzung von Widgets, Muster zur Zustandsverwaltung und die API-Integration mit Dart meistern, was eine schnelle App-Entwicklung und eine konsistente Benutzeroberfläche über alle Plattformen hinweg ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicativos móveis de alto desempenho e visualmente deslumbrantes usando Flutter, dominando a composição de widgets, padrões de gerenciamento de estado e integração de API com Dart, permitindo o desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos e UX consistente em todas as plataformas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные и визуально потрясающие мобильные приложения с использованием Flutter, освоив составление виджетов, шаблоны управления состоянием и интеграцию API с Dart, обеспечивая быструю разработку приложений и последовательный пользовательский опыт на всех платформах.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء تطبيقات محمولة عالية الأداء ومرئية رائعة باستخدام Flutter، وتحكم في تركيبة الويدجيتات وأنماط إدارة الحالة وتكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع Dart، مما يسمح بالتنمية السريعة للتطبيقات وتجربة المستخدم المتسقة عبر جميع المنصات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building iOS and Android apps with native performance","Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system","Implementing complex animations and visual effects","Rapidly developing apps with hot reload functionality"],"zh":["使用原生性能构建iOS和Android应用","使用Flutter的widget系统设计自定义UI","实现复杂的动画和视觉效果","使用热重载功能快速开发应用"],"ja":["ネイティブパフォーマンスでiOSとAndroidアプリを構築する","Flutterのウィジェットシステムを使用してカスタムUIを設計する","複雑なアニメーションと視覚効果を実装する","ホットリロード機能を使用して迅速にアプリを開発する"],"ko":["네이티브 성능으로 iOS와 안드로이드 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","Flutter의 위젯 시스템을 사용하여 커스텀 UI를 디자인하는 것","복잡한 애니메이션과 시각 효과를 구현하는 것","핫 리로드 기능을 사용하여 빠르게 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de iOS y Android con rendimiento nativo","Diseñar interfaces de usuario personalizadas con el sistema de widgets de Flutter","Implementar animaciones y efectos visuales complejos","Desarrollar aplicaciones de manera rápida con la función de recarga en caliente"],"fr":["Créer des applications iOS et Android avec des performances natives","Concevoir des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées avec le système de widgets Flutter","Mettre en œuvre des animations et des effets visuels complexes","Développer rapidement des applications avec la fonction de rechargement à chaud"],"de":["Erstellen von iOS- und Android-Apps mit nativem Leistungsvermögen","Entwerfen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen mit dem Flutter-Widget-System","Implementieren komplexer Animationen und visueller Effekte","Schnell entwickeln von Apps mit der Hot-Reload-Funktion"],"pt":["Construir aplicativos iOS e Android com desempenho nativo","Projetar interfaces de usuário personalizadas com o sistema de widgets do Flutter","Implementar animações e efeitos visuais complexos","Desenvolver aplicativos rapidamente com funcionalidade de recarregamento quente"],"ru":["Построение приложений iOS и Android с родной производительностью","Проектирование пользовательских интерфейсов с использованием системы виджетов Flutter","Реализация сложных анимаций и визуальных эффектов","Быстрая разработка приложений с функцией горячей перезагрузки"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات iOS و Android بأداء أصلي","تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة بنظام الويدجيتات في Flutter","تنفيذ الرسوم المتحركة والأ_effects المرئية المعقدة","تنمية التطبيقات بسرعة مع ميزة إعادة التحميل الساخنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart language knowledge","Limited to mobile app development","Dependent on Flutter framework updates"],"zh":["需要Dart语言知识","仅限于移动应用开发","依赖于Flutter框架更新"],"ja":["Dart言語の知識が必要","モバイルアプリ開発のみに限定される","Flutterフレームワークの更新に依存する"],"ko":["Dart 언어 지식이 필요","모바일 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한","Flutter 프레임워크 업데이트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje Dart","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Dependiente de las actualizaciones del framework Flutter"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage Dart","Limité au développement d''applications mobiles","Dépendant des mises à jour du framework Flutter"],"de":["Benötigt Dart-Sprachkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Mobile Apps","Abhängig von Updates des Flutter-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da linguagem Dart","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","Dependente de atualizações do framework Flutter"],"ru":["Требует знания языка Dart","Ограничен разработкой мобильных приложений","Зависит от обновлений фреймворка Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة Dart","محدود بالتنمية التطبيق المحمول","يعتمد على تحديثات إطار Flutter"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"57e2635b6fb1c90da9677074f70657227a67ebec4b903921c6ada849d0dd4a3f","qualityScore":51}');
