INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Winfred666/lightfield_linearsys/generate_synthetic_measurements', 'generate_synthetic_measurements', 'Winfred666', 'lightfield_linearsys', 'community', 'generate_synthetic_measurements Winfred666 lightfield_linearsys community The generate_synthetic_measurements skill simulates microscope measurements from 3D ground-truth volumes using precomputed system matrices. This benefits developers working on solver development and benchmarking generate_synthetic_measurements技能用于生成合成测量数据，需要3D地面真实数据和预计算的系统矩阵 generate_synthetic_measurementsスキルは、3D地面真実データと事前に計算されたシステム行列を使用して合成測定データを生成します generate_synthetic_measurements 스킬은 3D 지면 진실 데이터와 事前に 계산된 시스템 행렬을 사용하여 합성 측정 데이터를 생성합니다 El skill generate_synthetic_measurements simula mediciones de microscopio a partir de datos sintéticos y matrices de sistema precomputadas Le skill generate_synthetic_measurements génère des mesures synthétiques à partir de données synthétiques et de matrices de système précalculées Das Skill generate_synthetic_measurements simuliert Mikroskopiemessungen aus synthetischen Daten und vorkomputierten Systemmatrizen O generate_synthetic_measurements é uma habilidade que simula medições de microscópio em volumes 3D de verdade absoluta. Generate_synthetic_measurements — это навык, который симулирует измерения микроскопа в 3D-объёме истинных данных. generate_synthetic_measurements هو مهارة تقوم بتمثيل قياسات الميكروسكوب في الحجوم الثلاثية الأبعاد للواقع المطلق. how to use generate_synthetic_measurements generate_synthetic_measurements alternative generate_synthetic_measurements setup guide generate_synthetic_measurements vs simulation tools what is generate_synthetic_measurements generate_synthetic_measurements install microscope measurement simulation 3D ground-truth volume processing generate_synthetic_measurements AIエージェント 合成测量数据 3D地面真实数据 系统矩阵 求解器开发 基准测试 Simulates microscope measurements using precomputed system matrices (the forward operator $A$) Supports 3D ground-truth (GT) volumes as input ($x$) in reconstruction.pt format Generates output measurements ($b = Ax$) as .tif images Utilizes Interp_Vol_ID_*.pt files in a directory for system matrices Enables solver development and benchmarking generate_synthetic_measurements is a skill that generates synthetic measurements from 3D ground-truth volumes using precomputed system matrices');
