sue: Создание задач в GitHub с помощью ИИ...","ar":"دليل إعداد new-issue: إنشاء قضايا جديدة في GitHub باستخدا..."},"description":{"en":"Streamline your GitHub workflow with new-issue, an AI agent skill that helps create well-researched issues and prevents duplicates - learn how to get started...","zh":"了解新-issue 技术，使用终端界面创建 GitHub Issue，防止重复并节省时间","ja":"GitHub Issue を自動で作成する new-issue スキルを使用して、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"new-issue 技術을 사용하여 GitHub 이슈를 자동으로 생성하고 개발 효율성을 높여보세요","es":"Aprende a utilizar new-issue para crear problemas de GitHub de manera efectiva y prevenir duplicados","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser new-issue pour créer des incidents GitHub de manière efficace et éviter les doublons","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie new-issue verwenden, um GitHub-Probleme effektiv zu erstellen und Duplikate zu vermeiden","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o new-issue para criar issues no GitHub de forma eficiente e evitar duplicatas","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить new-issue для создания задач в GitHub и предотвращения дубликатов с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد new-issue لإنشاء قضايا جديدة في GitHub بطريقة فعالة وتجنب التكرار باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"new-issue is a terminal-based interface skill for creating and managing GitHub issues, designed to prevent duplicates and streamline the issue creation process.","zh":"新-issue 技术是用于创建 GitHub Issue 的终端界面工具","ja":"new-issue スキルは、GitHub Issue を自動で作成するためのTerminal ベースのインターフェイスです","ko":"new-issue 기술은 GitHub 이슈를 자동으로 생성하는 터미널 기반 인터페이스입니다","es":"new-issue es una herramienta de línea de comandos para crear problemas de GitHub de manera eficiente","fr":"new-issue est un outil en ligne de commande pour créer des incidents GitHub de manière efficace","de":"new-issue ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zur effizienten Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen","pt":"O new-issue é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar issues no GitHub de forma eficiente","ru":"new-issue - это инструмент, который помогает создавать задачи в GitHub","ar":"new-issue هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء قضايا جديدة في GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Creates well-researched GitHub issues using a terminal-based interface","Prevents duplicate issues and wasted effort","Activates when discovering bugs or issues outside the current task''s scope","Supports creation of issues for later tracking or improvement opportunities","Integrates with GitHub to create and manage issues"],"zh":["终端界面工具","自动创建 GitHub Issue","防止重复 Issue","提高开发效率","支持 GitHub 平台"],"ja":["Terminal ベースのインターフェイス","GitHub Issue の自動作成","重複 Issue の防止","開発効率の向上","GitHub プラットフォームのサポート"],"ko":["터미널 기반 인터페이스","GitHub 이슈 자동 생성","중복 이슈 방지","개발 효율성 향상","GitHub 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Creación de problemas de GitHub de manera efectiva","Prevención de duplicados y esfuerzo desperdiciado","Interfaz basada en terminal para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Integración con GitHub para un flujo de trabajo sin problemas","Capacidad para crear problemas fuera del alcance de la tarea actual"],"fr":["Création d''incidents GitHub de manière efficace","Prévention des doublons et de l''effort gaspillé","Interface basée sur terminal pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Intégration avec GitHub pour un flux de travail sans problème","Capacité à créer des incidents en dehors de la portée de la tâche actuelle"],"de":["Effektive Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen","Vermeidung von Duplikaten und verschwendeter Arbeit","Terminalbasierte Schnittstelle für eine flüssige Benutzeroberfläche","Integration mit GitHub für einen reibungslosen Arbeitsablauf","Fähigkeit, Probleme außerhalb des aktuellen Aufgabenbereichs zu erstellen"],"pt":["Criação de issues no GitHub","Prevenção de duplicatas","Interface baseada em terminal","Integração com o GitHub","Detecção de oportunidades de melhoria"],"ru":["Создание задач в GitHub","Предотвращение дубликатов","Терминальный интерфейс","Интеграция с GitHub","Обнаружение возможностей улучшения"],"ar":["إنشاء قضايا جديدة في GitHub","تجنب التكرار","واجهة قائم على الطرفية","التكامل مع GitHub","اكتشاف فرص التحسين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use new-issue","what is new-issue","new-issue alternative","new-issue vs github issues","new-issue install","new-issue setup guide","github issue creation","terminal-based issue management","ai agent for github"],"zh":["新-issue 技术","GitHub Issue 自动创建","终端界面工具","开发效率","Bug 跟踪","AI 技术","GitHub 平台"],"ja":["new-issue スキル","GitHub Issue 自動作成","Terminal ベースのインターフェイス","開発効率","バグ トラッキング","AI エージェント","GitHub プラットフォーム"],"ko":["new-issue 기술","GitHub 이슈 자동 생성","터미널 기반 인터페이스","개발 효율성","버그 트래킹","AI 도구","GitHub 플랫폼"],"es":["new-issue","creación de problemas de GitHub","herramienta de línea de comandos","terminal basado","GitHub","desarrollo de software","gestión de problemas","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["new-issue","création d''incidents GitHub","outil en ligne de commande","terminal basé","GitHub","développement de logiciels","gestion des incidents","outils de développement"],"de":["new-issue","Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen","Kommandozeilen-Tool","terminalbasiert","GitHub","Software-Entwicklung","Problemmangement","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["new-issue","criação de issues","github","terminal","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","integração com github","prevenção de duplicatas","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["new-issue","создание задач","github","терминал","инструмент разработки","интеграция с github","предотвращение дубликатов","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["new-issue","إنشاء قضايا جديدة","github","الطرفية","أداة تطوير","التكامل مع github","تجنب التكرار","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ainergiz","repo":"xfeed","repoPath":"ainergiz/xfeed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.614Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new-issue","description":"Create GitHub issues with duplicate detection and codebase analysis. Use when you discover a bug, improvement, or issue that wasnt in the original scope/spec during development. Triggers on phrases like create an issue, file a bug, this should be tracked, we should fix this later, out of scope issue, noticed a problem, found a bug.","bodyPreview":"# Smart GitHub Issue Creation\n\nThis skill helps create well-researched GitHub issues while preventing duplicates and wasted effort.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- You discover a bug or issue that''s **outside the current task''s scope**\n- You notice something that should be fixed but isn''t part of the current spec\n- The user mentions wanting to \"track this for later\" or \"create an issue\"\n- You find an improvement opportunity while working on something else\n- The user expli","body":"# Smart GitHub Issue Creation\n\nThis skill helps create well-researched GitHub issues while preventing duplicates and wasted effort.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- You discover a bug or issue that''s **outside the current task''s scope**\n- You notice something that should be fixed but isn''t part of the current spec\n- The user mentions wanting to \"track this for later\" or \"create an issue\"\n- You find an improvement opportunity while working on something else\n- The user explicitly asks to create an issue or file a bug\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Clarify the Issue\n\nIf the issue description is vague or missing, ask the user:\n> \"What issue would you like to create? Describe the bug, feature, or improvement.\"\n\n### Step 2: Check if Already Fixed/Implemented\n\nBefore creating, verify this isn''t already solved:\n\n1. **Search codebase** for related keywords:\n   ```bash\n   # Use Grep/Glob to find relevant code\n   ```\n\n2. **Check recent commits** (filter by relevant keywords):\n   ```bash\n   # Generic recent commits\n   gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits --jq ''.[0:20] | .[] | \"\\(.sha[0:7]) \\(.commit.message | split(\"\\n\")[0])\"''\n\n   # Targeted search for specific keywords (more useful)\n   gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits --jq ''[.[] | select(.commit.message | test(\"KEYWORD1|KEYWORD2\"; \"i\"))] | .[0:10] | .[] | \"\\(.sha[0:7]) \\(.commit.message | split(\"\\n\")[0])\"''\n   ```\n   Replace `KEYWORD1|KEYWORD2` with terms relevant to the issue (e.g., \"retweet|repost\" for a retweet bug).\n\n3. **If already fixed/implemented**, inform the user:\n   > \"It looks like this might already be addressed. I found [what you found]. Are you aware of this?\"\n\n   Options: \"Show me the existing solution\", \"Create the issue anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n### Step 3: Check Existing GitHub Issues\n\nSearch for duplicates:\n\n1. **Search open issues:**\n   ```bash\n   gh issue list --state open --limit 50 --json number,title,body,labels,url\n   ```\n\n2. **Search closed issues:**\n   ```bash\n   gh issue list --state closed --limit 30 --json number,title,body,labels,url,closedAt\n   ```\n\n3. **Keyword search:**\n   ```bash\n   gh search issues --repo {owner}/{repo} \"keywords\" --limit 20 --json number,title,body,url,state\n   ```\n\n4. **Fetch details with comments for promising matches:**\n   ```bash\n   gh issue view <number> --json number,title,body,comments,labels,state\n   ```\n\n5. **Based on findings:**\n\n   **EXACT DUPLICATE:**\n   > \"I found an existing issue #[number] - [title] that matches this. What would you like to do?\"\n   - Options: \"Add comment to existing\", \"View details\", \"Create anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   **RELATED ISSUE:**\n   > \"I found related issue #[number]. Your issue could be a comment, sub-issue, or separate. Preference?\"\n   - Options: \"Add as comment\", \"Create as sub-issue (I''ll activate gh-subissues skill)\", \"Create separate issue\"\n\n   **CLOSED ISSUE:**\n   > \"This was previously reported as #[number] and [fixed/rejected]. Context: [summary]. Still want to proceed?\"\n\n### Step 4: Research Potential Solutions\n\nIf you have enough context:\n\n1. **Explore codebase** for patterns and relevant files\n2. **Use web search** via Task tool for best practices\n3. **Formulate 1-3 approaches** with:\n   - Brief description\n   - Files that would need changes\n   - Trade-offs (if applicable)\n\n### Step 5: Draft Issue Content\n\nStructure the issue:\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n[1-2 sentences]\n\n## Context\n[Background, how discovered, why it matters]\n\n## Current Behavior (for bugs)\n[What happens now]\n\n## Expected Behavior\n[What should happen]\n\n## Potential Implementation (optional)\n### Approach 1: [Name]\n- Description\n- Files: `path/to/file.ts`\n\n## Additional Context\n[Related issues, screenshots, etc.]\n```\n\n### Step 6: Confirm Before Creating\n\nPresent a **concise summary** (don''t overwhelm with details upfront):\n\n> \"Ready to create issue:\n>\n> **Title:** [title]\n> **Summary:** [1-2 sentences max]\n>\n> Does this look good?\"\n\nOptions: \"Create the issue\", \"Show more details\", \"Edit first\", \"Cancel\"\n\n**If user selects \"Show more details\"**, then display:\n- Key findings from codebase exploration\n- Proposed implementation approaches\n- Files that would be affected\n\n### Step 7: Create the Issue\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"type(area): description\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n[structured content]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nThen display the URL and issue number.\n\n## Sub-Issue Support\n\nTo create as a sub-issue, say:\n> \"I''ll activate the gh-subissues skill to create this as a sub-issue of #[parent].\"\n\nThen use the Skill tool to invoke `gh-subissues`.\n\n## During Development: Out-of-Scope Issues\n\nWhen you notice an issue while working on something else:\n\n1. **Briefly mention it** to the user:\n   > \"While working on [current task], I noticed [issue]. This seems out of scope for the current work. Would you like me to create an issue to track this for later?\"\n\n2. **If user agrees**, run through this workflow\n3. **If user declines**, continue with the current task\n\nThis prevents scope creep while ensuring important issues aren''t forgotten.\n\n## Issue Title Conventions\n\nUse conventional format:\n- `fix(area): brief description` - Bug fixes\n- `feat(area): brief description` - New features\n- `refactor(area): brief description` - Code improvements\n- `docs(area): brief description` - Documentation\n- `chore(area): brief description` - Maintenance\n\n## Handling Screenshots & Attachments\n\nIf the user provides screenshots or images for the issue:\n\n1. **Check for attached files** in the conversation (e.g., `.context/attachments/`)\n2. **Read and understand** the images before drafting the issue\n3. **Create the issue first** (without images or with placeholder text) to get the issue number\n4. **Upload images with issue-prefixed names** to a draft release:\n\n```bash\n# Create or reuse a draft release for issue assets\ngh release view issue-assets 2>/dev/null || \\\n  gh release create issue-assets --draft --title \"Issue Assets\" --notes \"Screenshots for issues\"\n\n# Copy and rename with issue prefix (e.g., 216-description.png)\ncp \"path/to/screenshot.png\" /tmp/{issue#}-{description}.png\n\n# Upload the renamed file\ngh release upload issue-assets /tmp/{issue#}-{description}.png\n\n# Get the URL\ngh release view issue-assets --json assets --jq ''.assets[] | select(.name | startswith(\"{issue#}\")) | \"\\(.name): \\(.url)\"''\n```\n\n5. **Edit the issue** to add the image URLs (not as a separate comment):\n```bash\ngh issue edit {issue#} --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n[issue body with images]\n![description](https://github.com/owner/repo/releases/download/issue-assets/{issue#}-description.png)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**Naming convention:** `{issue#}-{description}.png` (e.g., `216-xfeed-display.png`, `216-xcom-expected.png`)\n\n**Note:** The `gh` CLI cannot upload images directly to issues ([feature requested since 2020](https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/1895)). Release assets are the cleanest workaround that keeps images within the repo''s GitHub ecosystem.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Always prioritize preventing duplicates - saves everyone time\n- Be thorough but concise - don''t overwhelm the user\n- For simple, clearly new issues, streamline the process\n- Keep the user informed at each decision point\n- Check for user-provided debug URLs and include them in the issue\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:19.166Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub-integrated AI Agents needing efficient issue tracking and creation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效问题跟踪和创建功能的 GitHub 集成 AI 代理。","ja":"GitHub 統合 AI エージェントが効率的な問題追跡および作成機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"효율적인 문제 추적 및 생성 기능이 필요한 GitHub 통합 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA integrados con GitHub que necesitan capacidades de seguimiento y creación de problemas eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA intégrés à GitHub nécessitant des capacités de suivi et de création de problèmes efficaces.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-integrierte KI-Agents, die effiziente Problemmeldungs- und Erstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA integrados ao GitHub que necessitam de capacidades de rastreamento e criação de problemas eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, интегрированных с GitHub, которым необходимы эффективные возможности отслеживания и создания проблем.","ar":"مثالي لعميلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكاملين مع GitHub الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تتبع وخلق مشاكل فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate well-researched GitHub issues while preventing duplicates, utilizing GitHub APIs for seamless integration and reducing wasted effort through automated issue validation.","zh":"赋予代理生成经过深入研究的 GitHub 问题的能力，同时防止重复问题的创建，利用 GitHub API 实现无缝集成，并通过自动问题验证减少浪费的努力。","ja":"エージェントが徹底的に調査された GitHub の問題を生成する能力を付与し、重複した問題の作成を防ぎ、GitHub API を使用してシームレスな統合を実現し、自動問題検証を通じて無駄な労力を減らします。","ko":"에이전트가 철저하게 조사된 GitHub 문제를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 중복된 문제 생성을 방지하며, GitHub API를 사용하여 무중단 통합을 구현하고, 자동 문제 검증을 통해 불필요한 노력을 줄입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar problemas de GitHub bien investigados mientras evita duplicados, utilizando las GitHub APIs para una integración sin problemas y reducir el esfuerzo desperdiciado a través de la validación automática de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des problèmes GitHub bien étudiés tout en évitant les doublons, en utilisant les API GitHub pour une intégration transparente et en réduisant les efforts gaspillés grâce à la validation automatique des problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, gut recherchierte GitHub-Probleme zu erstellen, während Duplikate vermieden werden, indem GitHub-APIs für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden und verschwendete Anstrengungen durch automatische Problemmeldungsvalidierung reduziert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar problemas do GitHub bem pesquisados, evitando duplicatas, utilizando as APIs do GitHub para integração transparente e reduzindo o esforço desperdiçado por meio da validação automática de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать хорошо исследованные проблемы GitHub, предотвращая дубликаты, используя API GitHub для бесшовной интеграции и снижая растраченные усилия посредством автоматической проверки проблем.","ar":"يمنح العميلاء القدرة على إنشاء مشاكل جيت هاب مدروسة جيدًا مع منع إنشاء مكررات، باستخدام واجهات برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب للتكامل السلس وخفض الجهد المهدور من خلال التحقق التلقائي من المشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bug reporting outside the current task''s scope","Generating issues for improvement opportunities","Preventing duplicate issue creation"],"zh":["自动化当前任务范围以外的错误报告","生成改进机会的问题","防止重复问题的创建"],"ja":["現在のタスクの範囲外のバグ報告の自動化","改善の機会の問題を生成する","重複した問題の作成を防ぐ"],"ko":["현재 작업 범위 외의 버그 보고를 자동화하는 것","개선 기회의 문제를 생성하는 것","중복 문제 생성을 방지하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de informes de errores fuera del ámbito de la tarea actual","Generación de problemas para oportunidades de mejora","Prevención de la creación de problemas duplicados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la notification de bogues en dehors de la portée de la tâche actuelle","Génération de problèmes pour des opportunités d''amélioration","Prévention de la création de problèmes en double"],"de":["Automatisierung von Fehlerberichten außerhalb des Bereichs der aktuellen Aufgabe","Erstellung von Problemen für Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten","Verhinderung der Erstellung von doppelten Problemen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de relatórios de bugs fora do escopo da tarefa atual","Gerar problemas para oportunidades de melhoria","Prevenir a criação de problemas duplicados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание отчетов об ошибках вне области текущей задачи","Генерировать проблемы для возможностей улучшения","Предотвращать создание дубликатов проблем"],"ar":["تحويل تقارير الأخطاء آليًا خارج نطاق المهمة الحالية","إنشاء مشاكل لفرص التحسين","منع إنشاء مشاكل مكررة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to GitHub issue tracking"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问","仅限 GitHub 问题跟踪"],"ja":["GitHub API アクセスが必要","GitHub 問題追跡に限定される"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요","GitHub 문제 추적에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado al seguimiento de problemas de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité au suivi des problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf die Problemmeldungsverfolgung von GitHub"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado ao rastreamento de problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub","Ограничен только отслеживанием проблем GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب","محدود بالتحديد لتتبع مشاكل جيت هاب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1cbafc7994897da52899011b9091ef8ec6d0a1502be46322a8539242ea64baa8","qualityScore":51}');
