INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ainergiz/xfeed/new-issue', 'new-issue', 'ainergiz', 'xfeed', 'community', 'new-issue ainergiz xfeed community The new-issue skill helps developers create well-researched GitHub issues while preventing duplicates and wasted effort, ideal for use when discovering bugs or issues outside the current task''s scope. 新-issue 技术是终端界面工具，用于创建 GitHub Issue，帮助开发者高效地记录和跟踪 Bug new-issue スキルは、GitHub Issue を自動で作成する Terminal ベースのインターフェイスです new-issue 기술은 GitHub 이슈를 자동으로 생성하는 터미널 기반 인터페이스입니다 new-issue es una interfaz basada en terminal para crear problemas de GitHub de manera efectiva new-issue est une interface basée sur terminal pour créer des incidents GitHub de manière efficace new-issue ist eine terminalbasierte Schnittstelle zur effektiven Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen O new-issue é uma interface baseada em terminal para criar issues no GitHub de forma eficiente new-issue - это терминальный интерфейс для создания задач в GitHub с помощью ИИ Агентов new-issue هو واجهة قائم على الطرفية لإنشاء قضايا جديدة في GitHub باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use new-issue what is new-issue new-issue alternative new-issue vs github issues new-issue install new-issue setup guide github issue creation terminal-based issue management ai agent for github 新-issue 技术 GitHub Issue 自动创建 终端界面工具 开发效率 Bug 跟踪 AI 技术 GitHub 平台 Creates well-researched GitHub issues using a terminal-based interface Prevents duplicate issues and wasted effort Activates when discovering bugs or issues outside the current task''s scope Supports creation of issues for later tracking or improvement opportunities Integrates with GitHub to create and manage issues new-issue is a terminal-based interface skill for creating and managing GitHub issues, designed to prevent duplicates and streamline the issue creation process.');
